<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Yohaanisa Wongela</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohaanisa Wongela</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoha</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohaanisa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohaanisi Xaafida</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yesuus Kiristoosa Wongela</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohaanisi Yesuusa, “Ase gididi asa giddon bentida Xoossa Qaala” yaagidi qoncisees. Ha wongelay xaafetiday, maxaafa nabbabiya oonika Yesuusi ase ashshanaw yaana geetetida Xoossa Na7a gideysa ammanana melanne iya ammaneysatas merina de7oy de7eysa enti erana melasa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:31">20:31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Wongelas koyro kifiley merinaw de7iya Xoossa qaalaynne Yesuusi issino gideysa odees. Yohaanisa wongelay, Yesuusi ashsheysa gididi yaana gida Xoossa Na7a gideysa bessiya dumma dumma malaatata qoncisees. Ha wongela xaafey, Yesuus Kiristoosi ba huuphen tuma Xoossa Na7anne Xoossa aawara issino gideysa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:1">1:1</ref></char>) qoncisis. Yesuusi ba huuphen, “Taani Abrahaamepe kase de7ayis” (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 8:58">8:58</ref></char>) yaagis. Wursethan Toomasi, “Ta Godaw, ta Xoossaw” yaagidi xeegis (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:28">20:28</ref></char>). Hessafe kaallidi, ha malaatatape bentida ayfiya odiya taariketi kaalloosona. Ha kifiley issi issi asi Yesuusa ammanidi iya kaalliya asi gididaysa odees; qassi harati iyara waanidi eqetidakonne waanidi ammanonna ixidaako odoosona. Shempo 13-17 gakanaw Yesuusi oyketida omarsi, ba tamaaretara iyaw ay mela mino gahetethi de7iyako, qassi wontetha gallas kaqetanaape sinthe giigetethinne minthetho qaala entaw odidaysa qoncisees. Wursetha shempoti Yesuusi oyketidabanne pirdas shiiqidaba, iya kaqetetha, iya denduwanne ba tamaaretas qoncida qoncetha odoosona.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqiya Yohaanisanne koyro Yesuusa tamaareta <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusi qoncen ooso oykis <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalaame heeran aathida wursetha saaminta <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hayqope dendonne asaas bentuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galilan zaaridi ba tamaaretas bentuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">De7o Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Qaalay koyro de7ees. Qaalayka Xoossara de7ees; he Qaalay Xoossaa. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Koyrope Qaalay Xoossara de7ees. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Xoossay ubbaba Qaala baggara medhis. Medhetidabaape issoyka iya baggara medhetonabay baawa. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Iyan de7oy de7ees; he de7oy asaas poo7o. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Poo7oy dhuman poo7ees; dhumay poo7uwa xoonibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Xoossay kiitida, issi Yohaanisa geetetiya asi de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1">Maato 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-2">Luqa 3:1-2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Asa ubbay poo7uwan ammanana mela I poo7os marka gididi yis. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />I poo7uwabaa markatanaw yisipe attishin, ba huuphen poo7o gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Asa ubbaas poo7isiya tuma poo7oy alamiya yees.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Qaalay alamen de7is. Xoossay Qaalan alamiya medhis, shin alamey iya eribeenna. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />I ba asaako yis, shin iya asay iya ekibookona. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Shin I bana ekidaysatasinne iya sunthan ammanidaysatas Xoossaa nayta gidana mela maata immis. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Enti Xoossafe yeletidosonape attishin, asi yeletiya wogan woyko adde shenen woyko asa amon yeletibookona. Xoossay I enta aawa.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Qaalay ase gidis; aadho keehatethaanne tumaa kumidi nu giddon de7is. I aawas issi na7aa gididi ekida iya bonchuwa nuuni be7ida.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohaanisi iyabaa markatis. Ba qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Taani, ‘Taape guyera yeysi taape kase de7iya gisho taape aadhees’ gada markatidaysi haysa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Nuuni ubbay iya aadho keehatetha kumethaafe anjo bolla anjo ekida. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Xoossay higgiya Muse baggara immis, shin aadho keehatethaynne tumatethay Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara yis. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Xoossaa be7ida asi oonika baawa; ba Aawa matan de7iya issi Na7aa xalaali baw Xoosse gididaysi iya qoncisis.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqiya Yohaanisa Markatethi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Maato 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-8">Luqa 3:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Yerusalaamen de7iya Ayhude halaqati, kahinetanne Leeweta, “Neeni oonee?” gidi, Yohaanisa oychana mela iyako kiittin, Yohaanisi entaw markatida markatethay haysa.<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohaanisi, “Taani Kiristoosa gidike” yaagidi, geeshshidi markatisipe attishin, kaddibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Enti, “Yaatin, neeni oonee? Neeni Eeliyaaseyee?” yaagidi oychidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Milki 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15-18">Zaare 18:15-18</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohaanisi, “Akay, gidike” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Qassi enti, “Neeni yaana geetetida nabiyayee?” yaagidi oychidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohaanisi, “Akay” gidi zaaris.<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Yaatin, “Neeni oonee? Nuuni nuna kiitidaysatas odana mela neeni nena oona gay?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohaanisi zaaridi, “Nabiya Isayaasi gidaysada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“ ‘Godaa ogiya suurisite!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">gidi mela biittan waassiya uraa qaalay tana”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Qassi Farsaaweti kiitida asati <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Yohaanisako, “Neeni Kiristoosa woyko Eeliyaasa woyko nabe gidonna ixiko, yaatin ayis xammaqay?” gidi oychidosona.<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohaanisi zaaridi, “Taani haathan xammaqayis, shin hinte eronna asi hinte giddon eqis. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />I taape guyera yees. Taani hari attoshin iya caammaa wodoruwa billanaw bessike” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Hessi ubbay Yordaanose Shaafape hefinthan, Bitaane kataman, Yohaanisi xammaqiya bessan hanis.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Xoossa Dorse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Yohaanisi wontetha gallas Yesuusi baako yishin be7idi, “Alamiya nagaraa quchiya Xoossaa Dorsay haysa! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Taani, ‘Taape guyera issi asi yaana. I taape kase de7iya gisho taape aadhees’ gada odidaysi haysa. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />I ooneko taani erike. Shin Isra7eele asaas iya qoncisanaw haathan xammaqashe yas” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yohaanisi haysada yaagidi markatis: “Geeshsha Ayyaanay salope holleda wodhishininne iyara de7ishin be7as. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Hessi hananaape kase taani iya erike. Shin haathan xammaqanaw tana kiitida Xoossay, ‘Geeshsha Ayyaanay wodhidi iyara de7ishin neeni be7anaysinne Geeshsha Ayyaanan xammaqanaysi iya’ yaagidi taw odis. <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Taani hessi hanishin be7ada, I Xoossaa Na7aa gididaysa markatayis” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koyro Yesuusa Tamaareta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Qassi wontetha gallas Yohaanisi ba tamaaretape nam7atara issife eqis. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Yesuusi aadhishin, Yohaanisi be7idi, “Xoossaa dorsay haysish!” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Yohaanisa nam7u tamaareti Yohaanisi geysa si7idi Yesuusa kaallidosona. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesuusi bana kaalleyisata guye simmi be7idi, “Ay koyeetii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Enti zaaridi, “Astamaariyaw, neeni awun de7ay?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesuusi entako, “Haa yidi be7ite” yaagis. Enti bidi I de7iyasuwa be7idosona. He gallas sa7i tammu saate heera gidiya gisho iya matan pee7idosona.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Yohaanisi gidaysa si7idi, Yesuusa kaallida nam7u tamaaretape issoy, Simoon Phexroosa ishaa Indiriyasa. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Indiriyasi koyro ba ishaa Simoonara gahetidi, “Nuuni Kiristoosa demmida” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Indiriyasi Simoona Yesuusako ehis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesuusi Simoona be7idi, “Neeni Yoona na7aa Simoona; ne sunthay Keefa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Keefa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giya qaalay Aramike doona gidishin, Girike doonan birshethay Phexroosa woyko zaalla guussu.</char></note> gidi xeegetana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filphoosanne Natina7eela Xeegetethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Wontetha gallas Yesuusi Galila biitta baanaw qofa qachis. I Filphoosara gahetidi, “Tana kaalla!” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filphoosi, Indiriyasinne Phexroosi de7ida Beetesayda katamaape yida ase.<verse eid="JHN 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filphoosi Natina7eelara gahetidi, “Musey higge maxaafan, qassi nabetika iyabaa xaafida Yoosefa na7aa Naazirete Yesuusa nuuni demmida” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natina7eeli zaaridi, “Naazirete katamaape lo77obay keyanaw danda7ii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filphoosi, “Yada be7a” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Natina7eeli baako yeysa Yesuusi be7idi, “Geney bayna tuma Isra7eele asi haysa!” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natina7eeli Yesuusako, “Neeni tana awun eray?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Filphoosi nena xeeganaape sinthe, neeni balase mithaa garsan de7ishin taani nena be7as” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natina7eeli zaaridi, “Astamaariyaw, neeni Xoossaa Na7aa! Neeni Isra7eele kawo!” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesuusi iyako, “Taani nena balase mithee garsan be7as gida gisho ammanay? Neeni haysafe aadhiyaba be7ana!” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Qassi Yesuusi, “Taani hintew tuma odayis; saloy dooyetin, Xoossaa kiitanchoti Asa Na7aa bolla keyishininne wodhishin hinte be7ana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Medhe 28:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Yaagano Bessan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Heedzantho gallas Galila biittan Qaana kataman yaaganoy yaaganetis. Yesuusa aayiya he yaaganuwan de7awusu. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesuusika ba tamaaretara issife he yaaganuwa xeegetis. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Woyne ushshay wurin, Yesuusa aayiya Yesuusako, “Entaw woyne ushshay wuris” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ta aaye, ne haysan gelopa? Ta wodey buroo gakibeenna” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Yesuusa aayiya oosanchotako, “I hintew odiyaba aybiba gidikoka oothite” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ayhudeti banta geeshsho wogaas go7etiya usupun shucha baathati he bessan de7oosona. Issi issi baathay nam7u woyko heedzu xugga oykees. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesuusi oosanchotako, “Baathatan haathe kunthite” yaagis. Enti baathatas doona gakanaw haathe kunthidosona. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Yesuusi entako, “Ha77i duuqidi yaaganuwa aawatethan poliseysas immite” yaagis. Enti iyaw efidi immidosona.<verse eid="JHN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Yaaganuwa aawatethan poliseysi woyne ushshi laametida haatha ganxi ekidi awupe yidaako eribeenna, shin haatha kunthida oosanchoti eroosona. Yaaganuwa aawatethan poliseysi machiw ekeysa xeegidi, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />“Oonika lo77o woyne ushsha asaa koyrottidi ushshees. Yaatidi asay uyi kallidaape guye, qiraariya immees. Shin neeni lo77o woyne ushsha hanno gakanaw wotha aggadasa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yesuusi ha koyro malaata Galila biittan Qaana kataman oothis; hessan ba gitatetha bessis. Iya tamaareti iya ammanidosona.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Hessafe guye, Yesuusi ba aayera, ba ishataranne ba tamaaretara issife Qifirnahooma katamaa bidi guutha gallas gam7is.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:13">Maato 4:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Keethafe Zal7eyisata Kessis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Maato 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luqa 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ayhudeti bonchiya Paasika Ba7aale gallasay matatin Yesuusi Yerusalaame bis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kessa 12:1-27</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Bidi xoossa keethan boorata, miizata, dorsatanne holleta bayzeysatanne banta oydiyan uttidi miishe laammeyisata demmis. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />I xurqafe dooqidi asaa ubbaa enta mehetara Xoossa Keethafe gooddidi kare kessis. Miishe laammeyisata xarpheezataka aathi yeggidi enta miishiya laallis. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Holle bayzeyisata, “Ha holleta haysafe kessite; ta Aawa keetha giya oothopite” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Iya tamaareti Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Taani ne keethas mishetiya mishay tana tamada xuuggees” geetetidi xaafetidaysa akeekidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Maz 69:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Hessafe guye, Ayhudeti zaaridi, “Ne haysa oothanaw new maati de7eysas nuna ay malaata oothada bessanee?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesuusi, “Ha Xoossa Keetha laallite; taani heedzu gallasan zaarada keexana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Maato 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mar 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Qassika Ayhudeti, “Ha Xoossa Keetha keexanaw oytamanne usupun laythi ekis, shin neeni heedzu gallasan keexanee?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Shin Yesuusi odiya Xoossa Keethay ba asatethaba. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Hessa gisho, Yesuusi hayqope dendidaape guye iya tamaareti I hessa gidaysa akeekidosona. Qassi enti Geeshsha maxaafan xaafetidaysanne Yesuusi odidaysa ammanidosona.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesuusi Paasika bonchiya bessan Yerusalaamen de7ishin, I oothida malaatata be7idi daro asay iya ammanidosona. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Shin Yesuusi asaa ubbaa eriya gisho enta ammanibena. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Asa wozanan de7iyaba I ba huuphen eriya gisho asaba oonika iyaw odana mela koshshibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusanne Niqodimoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Farsaaweta yaraape gidida, Ayhudeta halaqay, Niqodimoosa geetetiya issi addey de7ees. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Niqodimoosi qamma Yesuusako yidi, “Astamaariyaw, neeni Xoossay kiitida astamaare gideysa nuuni eroos. Ayis giiko, Xoossay iyara doonna ixiko ha neeni oothiya malaata oothanaw danda7iya asi baawa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani new tuma odayis; oonika zaari yeletonna ixiko Xoossaa kawotethaa be7anaw danda7enna” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Niqodimoosi, “Ceega asi waanidi zaari yeletanaw danda7ii? Ba aaye ulo simmi gelidi zaari yeletanaw danda7ii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani new tuma odayis; oonika haathafenne Geeshsha Ayyaanape yeletonna ixiko, Xoossaa kawotethaa gelanaw danda7enna. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Asho na7atethi aawupenne aayipe yees; Xoossaa na7atethi Geeshsha Ayyaanape imetees. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Taani, ‘Hinte zaari yeletanaw bessees’ gada hintew odida gisho neeni malaaletofa. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Carkoy ba koyida bessi carkees. Neeni iya kooshincha si7asape attishin, I awupe yaako woyko aw biyako eraka. Ayyaanape yeletida ubbay hessa mela” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Yaatin Niqodimoosi, “Hessi waanidi hananaw danda7ii?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Neeni Isra7eeleta astamaare gidashe haysa erikii? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Taani new tuma odayis; nu eriyaba odoosinne be7idaba markatoos, shin nu markatethaa hinte ekeketa. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Taani hintew sa7aba odin hinte ammanonnaba gidiko saloba odin waatidi ammananee? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Salope wodhida Asa Na7aape attishin, salo keyday oonika baawa; [salon de7iya Asa Na7ay tana”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Salon de7iya Asa Na7ay tana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi beni maxaafati gujoosona.</char></note> yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14-15" />Musey mela biittan Naase birata shooshi kaqidaysada tana ammanida ubbay merinaa de7uwa ekana mela Asa Na7ay dhoqu gaanaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Taybo 21:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Xoossaa Na7aa ammaniya ubbay merinaa de7uwa laattanaape attishin, dhayonna mela Xoossay ha alamiya daro dosida gisho ba issi Na7aa immis. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Xoossay ba Na7aa ha alamiya kiittiday alamiya pirdanaw gidonashin alamiya iya baggara ashshanaasa.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Na7aa ammaniya oonika pirdetenna, shin Na7aa ammanonna oonika issi Xoossaa Na7aa ammanibona gisho ha77i pirdetis. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Pirdayka haysa: poo7oy alamiya yis, shin asaa oosoy iita gidiya gisho asay poo7uwape aathidi dhumaa dosees. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Iitabaa oothiya oonika poo7o ixees. Ayis giiko, ba oosoy qonconna mela poo7uwako yeenna. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Shin tuma oothiya oonika Xoossay kiitidaysada I oothidaysa poo7oy qoncisana mela poo7uwako yees.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xammaqiya Yohaanisi Yesuusaba Markatis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Hessafe guye, Yesuusinne iya tamaareti Yihuda biitta bidosona. Yesuusi yan xammaqishe entara guutha wode uttis.<verse eid="JHN 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Qassi Yohaanisi Saleema matan de7iya Henoona giya bessan gidiya haathi de7iya gisho asaa yan xammaqees. Asayka yaa bidi xammaqetosona. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />He wode Yohaanisi buroo qashetibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Maato 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luqa 3:19-20</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Hessafe guye, Yohaanisa tamaaretinne issi Ayhude addey<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Issi Ayhude Addey: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi maxaafati “Guutha Ayhude asati” yaagosona.</char></note> geeshsho wogabaa palamidosona. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Enti Yohaanisako bidi, “Astamaariyaw, Yordaanose Shaafape hefinthan neera de7eysi, neeni iyabaa markatidaysi, Heko xammaqees. Asa ubbayka iyako boosona” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohaanisi zaaridi, “Xoossay immonna asi aybibaaka ekanaw danda7enna. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />‘Taani Kiristoosa gidike, shin iyape sinthe kiitetas’ gidaysas taw hinte, hinte huuphen marka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yoha 1:20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Gelos giigidaara ekenaw giigidaysasa. Ekeysa laggey iya matan eqidi I geysa si7iya wode daro ufaytees. Hessa gisho, haysi ta ufaysay poletis. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />I gitatanaw taani guuxanaw bessees” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Bollafe yeysi ubbaafe bolla. Sa7ape bentidaysi sa7aba. I sa7aba odees. Salope yeysi ubbaafe bolla. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />I ba be7idabaanne si7idaba markatees, shin iya markatethaa ekey baawa. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Iya markatethaa ekiya oonika Xoossay tuma gideysa qoncisees. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Xoossay ba geeshsha Ayyaana iyaw kumethi immiya gisho Xoossay kiittidaysi Xoossaa qaala odees. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Aaway ba Na7aa dosidi ubbaba iya kushen wothis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Maato 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luqa 10:22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Na7aa ammaniya uraas merinaa de7oy de7ees. Shin Na7aa ammanonaysa bolla Xoossaa hanqoy de7eesipe attishin, I de7o demmenna.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusanne Samaare Maccasiw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Yesuusi Yohaanisape daro kaalliya asaa baako shiisheysanne xammaqeysa Farsaaweti si7idosona. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Gidikoka Yesuusa tamaareti xammaqidosonape attishin, Yesuusi oonaka xammaqibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Yesuusi asay iyabaa geysa si7ida wode Yihudape dendidi Galila bis. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />I, Galila bishe Samaarera aadhanaysi attonnaba gidis.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Hessa gisho, Yayqoobi ba na7aa Yoosefas immida gadiya matan de7iya Sikaare geetetiya Samaare katamaa bis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Medhe 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iyya 24:32</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />He bessan Yayqooba haatha ollay de7ees. Yesuusi hemethan daaburidi he haatha olla matan uttis. He wode sa7i usupun saate heera.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Issi Samaare katamaa maccas he ollaafe haathe tikanaw yasu. Yesuusi he maccaseeko, “Tana haathe ushsharki” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />He wode Yesuusa tamaareti kathi shammanaw katama bidosonashin.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />He maccasiya zaarada, “Neeni Ayhude ase gidashe, Samaare maccas gidiya tana waanada haathe ushsha gay?” yaagasu. Hessa iya giday Ayhudeti Samaaretara gahetonna gishosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Izi 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:1-2">Nahi 4:1-2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Neeni Xoossa imotanne haathe tana ushsha geysi ooneko eridaba gidiyako iya ne woossana; ika new de7o immiya haathi immanashin” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Maccasiya zaarada, “Godaw, new duuqiyabay baawa; ollayka ziqa. Yaatin, de7o immiya haathi ne awupe ekanee? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Nuus ha haatha olla immida nu aawa Yayqoobape neeni aadhay? I, iya naytinne iya mehey ha ollaafe uyidosona” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesuusi, “Ha haathaafe uyida oonika zaari saamotana. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Shin taani immana haatha uyaa oonika ubbaka saamotenna. Taani immiya haathay iya giddon merinaa de7o immiya goggiya pulto gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Maccasiya zaarada, “Godaw, taani saamotonna melanne haathe tikanaw ha bessaa yoonna mela taw he haatha imma” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesuusi iiko, “Bada ne azinaa xeegada ya” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Maccasiya zaarada, “Taw azini baawa” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesuusi iiko, “Taw azini baawa gashe balabaka. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />New kase ichashu azinati de7oosona. Ha77i neera de7iya addey ne azina gidenna. Neeni ha77i tuma odadasa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Maccasiya zaarada, “Godaw, neeni nabe gideysa taani eras. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Nu aawati ha zumaa bolla Xoossaa goyinnidosona. Shin hinte Ayhudeti asi Xoossas goyinnanaw bessiya bessay Yerusalaamena geeta” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesuusi, “Ha maccasete tana ammana; ha zumaa bolla woyko Yerusalaamen Aawas hinte goyinnona wodey yaana. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Hinte Samaareti eronnaysa goyinneta. Shin nuuni atotethay Ayhudepe yaa gisho nu ereysa goyinnoos. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Shin Aawas tuman goyinneysati Ayyaananinne tumatethan goyinnana wodey matatis; ha77ika gakis. Hiza, Aaway koyey haysa mela ogiyan goyinneyisata. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Xoossay Ayyaana; iyaw goyinneysati Ayyaananinne tumatethan goyinnanaw bessees” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Maccasiya zaarada, “Kiristoosi yaanaysa taani erayis. I yaa wode nuus ubbaba odana” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesuusi, “Ha neera odetey taani iya” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Enti odetishin, Yesuusa tamaareti bida bessaafe simmidosona. Yesuusi maccasara odetishin enti be7idi daro malaaletidosona. Shin maccaseeko, “Ay koyay?” Woyko Yesuusako, “Iira ayis odetay?” giday oonika baawa.<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Hessafe guye, maccasiya ba haatha otuwa aggada guye katamaa bada asaako, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Taani oothidaba ubbaa taw odida addiya be7anaw yedhite. I Kiristoosa gidandesha?” yaagasu. <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Asay katamaape keyidi Yesuusako bidosona.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Hessi hanishin, iya tamaareti Yesuusako, “Guuthaba marki” yaagidi woossidosona.<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Shin I, “Taw hinte eronna kathi ta meysi de7ees” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Hessa gisho, iya tamaareti banta giddon, “Iyaw miyaba asi ehonna aggenna” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesuusi entako, “Ta kathay tana kiittidaysa sheniya oothanaysanne iya oosuwa polanaysa. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Hinte, ‘Oyddu ageenape guye kathay caketana’ geeketiyee? Shin taani hintew odayis; kathay kaxidi shiishoos gakidaysa loythi xeellite. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Zereysinne cakeysi issife ufaytana mela cakeysi damooziya ekees qassi kathaa merinaa de7os shiishees. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Hiza, ‘Issoy zerees; hankoy qassi cakees’ giya oday tuma. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Hinte daaburiboonaysa shiishana mela taani hintena kiittas. Harati oothi daaburidasuwan gelidi hinte enta daabura ayfiya ekideta” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Maccasiya, “I, taani oothida ubbaba odis” gada markatida gisho he kataman de7iya Samaare asaape daroti Yesuusa ammanidosona. <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Samaare asay Yesuusako yidi, banta matan gam7ana mela Yesuusa woossin I yan nam7u gallas uttis.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />I odiya qaala gisho kaseysafe daro asay ammanidosona. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Qassi enti maccaseeko, “Ha77i nu ammaney nu huuphen I geysa si7ida gishosafe attishin, neeni markatida gishosa gidenna. Qassi I tuma ha alamiya ashsheysa gideysa nuuni erida” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Issi Shuuma Na7a Paxuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Nam7u gallasape guye, Yesuusi yaape keyidi Galila biitta bis. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yesuusi ba huuphen, “Nabey ba biittan bonchetenna” yaagidi kasetidi odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Maato 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mar 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luqa 4:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Yesuusi Galila gakida wode Galila asay iya mokidosona. Ayis giiko, Paasika Ba7aale bonchiya gallas enti Yerusalaamen de7iya gisho I oothidaba ubbaa be7idosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Yoha 2:23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesuusi haatha woyne ushshi laammida bessaa, Galilan de7iya Qaana katama bis. Qifirnahooman kawo keethan oothiya issi shuumas na7ay hargetis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Yoha 2:1-11</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Yesuusi Yihudape Galila yidaysa he shuumay si7idi iyako yis. Hayqanaw matida ba na7aa bidi pathana mela Yesuusa woossis.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesuusi shuumako, “Xoossay oothiya malaatatanne oorathabata be7onna de7ishe hinte ubbaraka ammaneketa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Shuumay zaaridi, “Godaw, ta na7ay hayqonna de7ishin taara yedharki” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesuusi, “Ne soo ba; ne na7ay paxana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">He shuumay Yesuusi gidaysa ammanidi ba soo bis. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />I ba soo bishin iya aylleti iyako yishe iyara ogen gahetidi, “Ne na7ay paxis” gidoosona.<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />I ba aylleta ba na7aas ay saaten lo77idaako oychis. Enti zaaridi, “Zine laapun saaten mishay aggis” yaagidosona. <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Na7aa aaway Yesuusi baako, “Ne na7ay paxana” giday he saatiyan gideysa akeekis. Hessa gisho, inne iya soo asa ubbay ammanidosona.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Hessi Yesuusi Yihudape Galila yidi oothida nam7antho malaata.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Gunda Ura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Ayhudeti bonchiya baaliya bonchanaw Yerusalaame bis. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Yerusalaamen Dorsa Pengiya matan Ibraawetho doonan Beetesayda giya teqetida haathi de7ees. He teqeti uttida haatha matan ichashu shempiya bessati de7oosona. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />[Hessan haathay qaaxanaysa naagiya] daro harganchoti, qooqeti, wobbetinne gundati zin7idosona. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />[Ayis giiko, issi issi toho Godaa kiitanchoy teqetida haathan wodhidi haatha qaathees. Haathay qaaxiya wode koyro gelida uray bana oykida ay hargefeka paxees.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi beni maxaafati paydo heedzas koyro bagganne paydo oydda gujokona.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />He bessan hastamanne hospun laythi hargetida issi addey de7ees. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesuusi yan zin7ida addiya be7idi, qassi daro wode hargetidaysa eridi addiyako, “Paxanaw koyay?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Harganchoy zaaridi, “Godaw, haathay qaaxiya wode tana haathan yeggiya asi baawa. Taani gelana haniya wode haray taape sinthatidi geli kichees” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesuusi iyako, “Denda eqa; ne algaa tookada ba” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Addey iiraka paxis; ba algaa tookidi bis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Hessi Sambaata gallasan hanis. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Hessa gisho, Ayhudeti paxida addiyako, “Hachi sa7i Sambaata; neeni ne algaa tookeysi woga gidenna” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Nahi 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Ermi 17:21</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Shin addey, “Tana pathidaysi, ne algaa tookada ba gis” yaagidi zaaris.<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Enti iyako, “Nena, ne algaa tookada ba giday I oonee?” yaagidi oychidosona.<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Shin Yesuusi he bessan daro asaa giddora erisonna kanthidi bida gisho addey bana pathiday ooneko erenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Yesuusi guyepe he addiya xoossa keethan demmidi, “Heko, neeni paxadasa; haysafe iitabay nena gakonna mela zaarada nagara oothofa” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Hessafe guye, addey bidi bana pathidaysi Yesuusa gididaysa Ayhudetas odis.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Yesuusi hessa Sambaata gallas oothida gisho, Ayhudeti Yesuusa goodda oykidosona. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ta Aaway ubba wode oothees; taka oothanaw bessees” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Yesuusi Sambaata bonchona gisho xalaalas gidonashin Xoossay ba Aawa gidi bana Xoossara giigisida gisho, Ayhudeti iya wodhanaw kasepe minthidi koydosona.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani hintew tuma odayis; Na7ay barka aykoka oothanaw danda7enna. I ba Aaway oothishin be7oysa xalaala oothees. Aaway ootheysa Na7ayka oothees. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Aaway ba Na7aa dosiya gisho I oothiya ooso ubbaa ba Na7aa bessees. Hinte malaaletana mela I haysafe aadhiya ooso ba Na7aa bessaana. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Aaway hayqidaysata hayqope denthidi entaw de7o immeysada Na7ayka ba koyeysatas de7o immees. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Aaway Na7aas pirda maata ubbaa immispe attishin, I oonaka pirdenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Asa ubbay Aawa boncheysada Na7aaka bonchana. Na7aa bonchona oonika Na7aa kiitida Aawaka bonchenna.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Taani hintew tuma odayis; ta qaala si7eysasinne tana kiittidaysa ammaneysas merinaa de7oy de7ees. I hayqope de7on pinnida gisho pirdetenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Taani hintew tuma odayis; hayqida asay Xoossaa Na7aa qaala si7iya wodey yaana; hessika ha77i. He qaala si7ey de7on daana. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Aaway de7os pulto gididaysada Na7aaka de7os pulto oothis. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Na7ay Asa Na7a gidiya gisho Aaway Na7aas pirda maata immis.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />“Duufon de7eysati iya qaala si7idi dendiya wodey yaana gisho haysan malaaletofite. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Lo77o oothidaysati de7on daanaw qassi iita oothidaysati pirda ekanaw duufope dendana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Daane 12:2</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Taani ta maatan aybibaaka oothanaw danda7ike. Xoossay taw odidaysada pirdayis. Taani tana kiittidaysi koyaba oothaysipe attishin, ta koyaba oothonna gisho ta pirday tuma.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Taani tabaa markatiko ta markatethay tuma gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Tabaa markatiya hari de7ees; I tabaa markateysi tuma gideysa taani erayis.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />“Hinte Yohaanisako ase kiittin I tumaas markatis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Yoha 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Taani hessa hintew odey, hinte attana mela gadape attishin, asa markatethi taw koshshin gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohaanisi muqaadada eexishe poo7is. Hinte guutha wode iya poo7uwan ufaytideta.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />“Shin taw Yohaanisape aadhiya marki de7ees. Taani oothana mela ta Aaway taw immida oosoti tabaa markatoosona; Aaway tana kiittidaysa qoncisosona.<verse eid="JHN 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />“Qassi tana kiitida Aawayka ba huuphen tabaa markatees. Hinte iya qaala ubbaraka si7ibeeketa woyko iya malaa be7ibeeketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Maato 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luqa 3:22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />I kiittidaysa hinte ammanonna gisho iya qaalay hinte wozanan baawa.<verse eid="JHN 5:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />“Geeshsha Maxaafatape merinaa de7o demmanabaa hintew daanin enta pilgeeta; enti tabaa markatoosona. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Shin hinte de7o demmanaw taako yaanaw koyeketa.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Asape taani boncho koyke. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Shin taani hinte wozanan Xoossaa siiqoy baynaysa erayis. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Taani ta Aawa maatan yas, shin tana mokibeketa. Haray ba maatan yaa wode iya mokeeta. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Hinte issoy issuwafe boncho koyeysati, issi Xoossaafe yaa galata ekanaw koyonnaysati, waanidi tana ammananaw danda7eetii?<verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />“Taani ta Aawa sinthan hintena mootiyaba hintew daanopo. Hintena mootanay hinte ufaysan naagiya Muse. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Hinte Muse ammanidaba gidiyako I tabaa xaafida gisho tanaka ammananashin. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Shin hinte I xaafidaysa ammanonna ixiko ta qaala waatidi ammananee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ichashu Mukulu Asaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Maato 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luqa 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Xibradoosa geetetiya Galila Abbaafe hefinthi pinnis. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />I harganchota pason oothida malaata be7ida gisho, daro asay iya kaallidosona. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesuusi zumaa bolla keyidi, yan ba tamaaretara issife uttis. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Ayhudeti bonchiya Paasika Ba7aale gallasay gakis. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesuusi daro asay baako yeysa be7idi Filphoosako, “Ha asaa ubbaa muzanaw gidiya kathi awupe shammanee?” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />I hessa Filphoosa paacanaw gisipe attishin, I ba huuphen ay oothaneko erees.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filphoosi zaaridi Yesuusako, “Hari attoshin, Huuphen huuphen, issi issi barsi gathanaw, nam7u xeetu dinaaren<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Dinaare: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi dinaarey issi asi issi gallas oothi pee7idi ekiya miishe. Nam7u xeetu dinaarey issi asi laytha bagga oothidi ekiya miishe keena. (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 20:2">Maato 20:2</ref></char>) xeellite.</note> uythu shamminka gidenna” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Qassi Yesuusa tamaaretape issoy, Simoon Phexroosa ishay Indiriyasi, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Ichashu banga uythinne nam7u molo oykida issi na7ay haysan de7ees, shin ha asa ubbaas hessi ay maaddanee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesuusi ba tamaaretako, “Asaa utisite” yaagis. He bessan daro maati de7ees; asa ubbay uttis. Adde asaa tayboy ichashu mukulu gidana. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesuusi uythaa ekidi Xoossaa galati simmidi yan uttida asaas gishis. Moluwaka ekidi hessada oothidi immin, asay ba koydaysa mela mis. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Enti ubbay kallidaape guye, Yesuusi ba tamaaretako, “Issibayka iitonna mela attida tiifiya shiishite” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Hessa gisho, enti ubbaa shiishidosona. Asay min attida banga uytha tiifiya shiishidi tammanne nam7u gayta kunthidosona.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Asay Yesuusi oothida malaatata be7ida wode, “Haysi tuma ha alamiya yaana geetetida nabiya” yaagidosona. <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesuusi enti iya oykidi wolqan kawo oothanaw haneysa eridi, barka zumaa bolla zaaridi keyis.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Abba Bollara Hemetis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Maato 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Sa7ay omarsida wode Yesuusa tamaareti abbaako wodhidosona. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Sa7ay qammida gishonne Yesuusi buroo entako yiboona gisho iya tamaareti wogolon gelidi abba pinnidi Qifirnahooma baanaw dendidosona. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Wolqaama carkoy carkida gisho abbay qaaxees. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ichashu woyko usupun kilo mitire gideysa mela enti abba pidhidi bidaape guye, Yesuusi abba bollara hemetishe yeysa be7idi yayyidosona. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Shin I, “Babofite, tana” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Enti ufaytidi iya wogoluwan gelsidosona; iiraka wogoloy enti biya abba gaxa gakis.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi De7o Uythu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Wontetha gallas abbaafe hefinthan attida daro asay issi wogolo xalaali de7eysa be7idosona. Yesuusi ba tamaaretara wogoluwan gelidi, entara boonnaysanne enti bantarka bidaysa akeekidosona. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Shin Xibradoosape hara wogoloti Yesuusi Xoossaa galatin, asay uythaa mida bessaa yidosona. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Asay Yesuusi woyko iya tamaareti yan baynaysa be7idi, Yesuusa koyanaw wogolotan gelidi Qifirnahooma bidosona.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Asay Yesuusa abbaafe hefinthan demmida wode, “Astamaariyaw, haa awude yadii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani hintew tuma odayis; hinte tana koyey uythi midi kallida gishosafe attishin, malaata be7ida gishosa gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Samiya kathas oothopite, shin merinaa de7o immiya kathas oothite. Xoossaa Aaway I oothana mela iyaw maata immida gisho he katha Asa Na7ay hintew immana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Yaatin enti, “Nuuni Xoossaa oosuwa oothanaw ay oothanee?” yaagidi Yesuusa oychidosona.<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hinte oothana mela Xoossay koyiya oosoy haysa: I kiittidaysa ammanite” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Enti zaaridi, “Nuuni be7idi, nena ammanana mela ay malaata ne bessanee? Ne ay oothanee? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Geeshsha Maxaafan, ‘Enti maana mela uythu salope immis’ geetetidi xaafetidaysada nu aawati mela biittan manna midosona” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:4">Kessa 6:4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Maz 78:24</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesuusi, “Taani hintew tuma odayis; hintew salope tuma uythaa immiday ta Aawape attishin, Muse gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Hiza, Xoossay immiya uythay salope wodhidaysi alamiyas de7o immeysa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Enti zaaridi, “Godaw, nuus he uythaa ubba wode imma” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesuusi, “Taani de7o immiya uythaa; taako yaa oonika ubbaraka koshatenna. Qassi tana ammaniya uray ubbaraka saamotenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Shin taani hintew odas; hinte tana be7ideta, shin ammaneketa. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Ta Aaway taw immiya ubbay taako yaana; qassi taako yaa oonaka kare yeddike. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Taani ta koyaba oothanaw gidonashin tana kiittidaysi koyaba oothanaw salope yas. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Tana kiittidaysi koyey haysa: taani I taw immida ubbataka wursetha gallas hayqope denthana melape attishin, issuwaka dhaysana mela koyenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Hiza, ta Aaway koyey hessa: Na7aa be7idi ammaniya ubbay merinaa de7uwa ekana; taani he ubbaa wursetha gallas merinaa de7os hayqope denthana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Yesuusi, “Taani salope wodhida uythaa” gida gisho, Ayhudeti iya bolla zuuzumidosona. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Enti, “Haysi nuuni iya aawanne iya aayiw eriya Yoosefa Na7aa Yesuusa gidennee? Yaatin, I waanidi, ‘Taani salope wodhas’ gaanaw danda7ii?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Issoy issuwara zuuzuntha aggite. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Tana kiitida ta Aaway taako ehiya asape attishin, taako yaanaw danda7iya oonika baawa. Taani wursetha gallas iya merinaa de7os hayqope denthana. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Nabeti, ‘Xoossay asa ubbaa tamaarsana’ yaagidi xaafidosona. Aawa si7eysinne iyape tamaariya oonika taako yees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa 54:13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Xoossaa matape yidaysafe attishin, Aawa be7iday oonika baawa; iya xalaali Aawa be7is.<verse eid="JHN 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />“Taani hintew tuma odayis; tana ammaniya oodeska merinaa de7oy de7ees. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Taani de7o immiya uythaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Hinte aawati mela biittan manna midosona, shin hayqidosona. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Salope yaa uythay haysa; he uythaa miya oonika hayqenna. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Salope yida de7o uythay tana. Oonika ha uythaa miiko merinaw daana. Qassi ha alamey de7on daana mela taani hintew immana uythay ta ashuwa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Ayhudeti, “Ha addey ba ashuwa nu maana mela nuus waatidi immanaw danda7ii?” yaagidi banta giddon palamidosona.<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Hessa gisho, Yesuusi entako, “Taani hintew tuma odayis; Asa Na7aa ashuwa, hinte moonna ixiko, qassi iya suuthaa hinte uyonna ixiko, hintew de7oy baawa. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Ta ashuwa miya uraasinne ta suuthaa uyaa uraas merinaa de7oy de7ees. Taani wursetha gallas iya hayqope denthana. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Ta ashoy tuma kathi; ta suuthayka tuma ushshu. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Ta ashuwa miya uraynne ta suuthaa uyaa uray tanan de7ees; taka iyan de7ayis. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />De7o Aaway tana kiittin, taani iya baggara de7on de7eysada, tana miya urayka ta gaason de7on daana. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Salope wodhida uythay haysa: hinte aawati midi hayqida manna mela gidenna; ha uythaa miya uray merinaw daana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesuusi Qifirnahooma kataman ayhude woosa keethan haysa tamaarsis.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Merina De7o Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Yesuusa tamaaretape dariya baggay hessa si7ida wode, “Haysi gelonna timirte; haysi ooddes gelii?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesuusi ba tamaareti hessas zuuzumidaysa eridi, “Haysi hintena dhubbii? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Yaatin, Asa Na7ay kase de7iyasuwa pude keyishin hinte be7idi woygandetii? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Geeshsha Ayyaanay de7o immees; asa wolqi aykoka maaddenna. Ta hintew odiya qaalay de7o immiya Geeshsha Ayyaanape yees. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Shin hinte giddon ammanonaysati de7oosona” yaagis. Ammanonaysati oonanteko Yesuusi koyrope doomidi erees. Qassi bana aathidi immanay ooneko erees. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Qassika Yesuusi, “Aaway ba goonna oonika taako yaanaw danda7enna gada taani odiday hessa gishosa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Hessa gaason, Yesuusa kaalleysatape daroti iya aggidi guye simmidosona; zaari iya kaallibookona. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesuusi ba tammanne nam7u tamaaretako, “Hinteka aggidi baanaw koyeetii?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoon Phexroosi zaaridi, “Godaw, nuuni oodeko baanee? New merinaa de7o immiya qaalay de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:68 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Maato 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mar 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Luqa 9:20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Neeni Xoossaa Geeshshaa gideysa nuuni ammanoosinne eroos” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesuusi entako, “Taani hintena tammanne nam7ata doorabikina? Shin hintefe issoy Xalahe” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesuusi hessa giday Simoona Na7aa Asqoroota Yihudasa. Yihudi Yesuusa aathidi immanaw de7iya tammanne nam7u tamaaretape issuwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusanne Iya Ishata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Hessafe guye, Ayhudeti Yesuusa wodhanaw koyiya gisho I Yihuda aggidi Galilan simeretees. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ayhudeti bonchiya Shaqara Ba7aaley bonchetanaw matis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Leewe 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Zaare 16:13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Hessa gisho, Yesuusa ishati, “Ne tamaareti neeni oothiya malaatata be7ana mela haysafe dendada Yihuda biitta ba. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Baw eretanaw koya asi oonika ba oosuwa genthenna. Neeni haysata oothada nebaa alamiya erisa” yaagidosona. <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Iya ishati hessa giday iyan ammanibona gishosa.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesuusi entako, “Taw inje wodey gakibeenna, shin hintew ubba wodey injetees. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Alamey hintena ixanaw danda7enna, shin taani alamiya oosoy iita gideysa markatiya gisho tana ixees. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Hinte baaliya biite; ta wodey gakiboonna gisho taani baaliya biike” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />I hessa gidi Galilan attis. <verse eid="JHN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Iya ishati ba7aale bonchanaw bidaape guye Yesuusi oonaka erisonna qosan he bessaa bis. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Ayhudeti ba7aale bonchiya bessan, “I awun de7ii?” yaagidi iya koydosona.<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Asay kalkashidi iyabaa odetoosona. Baggay, “I lo77o asi” giya wode harati qassi, “Akay, I asaa balethees” yaagosona. <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Shin Ayhude halaqatas yayyida gisho oonika iyabaa qoncen odetenna.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Baaliya bonchidi giddo gathiya wode Yesuusi Xoossa Keethi bidi tamaarso oykis. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Ayhudeti, “Ha addey timirte tamaaronna haysa ubbaa waati eridee?” yaagidi malaaletidosona.<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ta tamaarsiya timirtey tana kiitida Xoossaa matape yaa timirtefe attishin, tabaa gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Xoossaa sheniya oothanaw koyiya oonika ha timirtey Xoossaa matape yaakonne woyko taani taape odiyako erana. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Babaa odiya oonika ba huuphe boncho koyees. Shin bana kiittidaysa bonchuwa koyiya oonika I tumancho; iyan wordoy baawa. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Musey hintew higgiya immis, shin hintefe oonika higgiya naagibeenna. Yaatin ayis tana wodhanaw koyeetii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Asay zaaridi, “Nena Xalahey oykis; nena wodhanaw oonee koyey?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesuusi, “Taani issi malaata oothin hinte ubbay malaaletideta. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Hinte, hinte nayta qaxarana mela Musey kiittis. Shin qaxaro hinte mayzati doomidosonape attishin, Muse gidenna. Hessa gisho, hinte Sambaata gallas adde nayta qaxareeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leewe 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:10">Medhe 17:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Muse higgey kiitida gisho, hinte Sambaata gallas qaxariyabaa gidiko, taani issi asa kumetha asatethaa pathida gisho, taara ayis kacceetii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Yoha 5:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Tuma pirda pirditepe attishin, asa som7o be7idi pirdofite” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi, I Kiristoosee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Yerusalaame asaape issoti issoti, “Enti wodhanaw koyiya uray haysa gidennee? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Heko, I qoncen odees; enti iya aykoka gookona. I Kiristoosa gideysa Ayhude halaqati tuma eridonaasha? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Kiristoosi yaa wode I awupe yaako oonika erenna, shin I awupe yidaako nu eroos” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesuusi xoossa keethan tamaarsishe ba qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Tuma hinte taani oonekonne ta awupe yidaako ereetii? Taani ta maatan yabiike, shin tana kiittidaysi tumancho; hinte iya ereketa. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Shin taani I kiittin iya matape yida gisho iya erayis” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Hessa gisho, enti iya oykanaw koydosona. Shin iya wodey buroo gakiboonna gisho oonika iya bolla kushe wothibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Shin daro asay Yesuusa ammanidi, “Kiristoosi yaa wode ha uray oothida malaatatape dariya malaata oothaneyee?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Farsaaweti daro asay Yesuusaba kalkasheysa si7idosona. Kahine halaqatinne Farsaaweti iya oythidi qashisanaw Xoossa Keethi naageysata kiittidosona.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesuusi, “Taani hintera guutha wode gam7ana; hessafe guye tana kiittidaysako baana. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Hinte tana koyana, shin demmeketa. Taani de7iyasuwa hinte yaanaw danda7eketa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Ayhudeti issoy issuwara, “Haysi nuuni demmonaso aw baana hanii? Girike kataman de7iya Ayhudetako bidi Giriketa tamaarsanaw haniyee? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />‘Hinte tana koyana, shin demmeketa’ qassi, ‘Taani de7iyasuwa hinte yaanaw danda7eketa’ guussay ay guussee?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">De7o Haathe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Baaliya bonchiya gallasatape wolqaamanne wursetha gallasan Yesuusi dendidi, ba qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Saamotida oonika taako yidi uyo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Leewe 23:36</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Tana ammaniya oonika Geeshsha Maxaafay gidaysada de7o immiya pulto haathay iyape goggana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Hiz 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zaka 14:8</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />I hessa giday iya ammanidaysati ekanaw de7iya Geeshsha Ayyaanaba. Yesuusi buroo bonchetiboona gisho, he wode Geeshsha Ayyaanay imetibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />He asaape daroti I geysa si7idi, “Tuma haysi nabiya”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nabiya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha bessan nabiya geetetiday yaana gidi enti naagiya nabiya qoncisees. (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:21">Yoha 1:21</ref></char> xeellite.) </note> yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Harati qassi, “Haysi Kiristoosa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Shin harati qassi, “Kiristoosi Galilape waanidi keyii? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Geeshsha Maxaafay, ‘Kiristoosi Dawita sheeshape Dawiti de7ida Beeteleme katamaape yaana’ yaageneyee?” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Same 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Miki 5:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Hessa gisho, Yesuusa gaason asay banta giddon shaaketidosona. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />He asaape issoti issoti iya oykanaw koydosona, shin oonika iya bolla kushe wothibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhude Halaqati Ammanibookona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Xoossa Keetha naageysati kahine halaqatakonne Farsaawetako guye simmi yin enti, “Ayis iya ehibeketii?” yaagidi oychidosona.<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Xoossa Keetha naageysati entako, “Ha addey odeteysatho oonika odetenna” yaagidi zaaridosona.<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Farsaaweti zaaridi, “I hintenaka balethidee? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ayhude halaqatape woyko Farsaawetepe iya ammanida asi de7ii? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Muse higgiya eronna ha asay baadetidaysata” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Farsaawetape issoy qamma Yesuusako bida Niqodimoosi entako,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Yoha 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Issi asi giyaba si7onna woyko I ay oothidaako eronna de7ishe koyrottidi iya bolla pirdeysi nu higgiyan de7ii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Enti zaaridi, “Neenika qassi Galila biitta asee? Galila biittafe nabey keyonnaysa Geeshsha Maxaafape pilgada demma” yaagidosona. <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Issoy issoy aggidi ba soo ba soo bis.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Laymatethan Oyketida Maccasiw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Shin Yesuusi Shamaho zuma bolla keyis. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Qassi wontetha gallas guura Xoossa Keethi simmis. Daro asay iyako yin uttidi enta tamaarsis. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Higge astamaaretinne Farsaaweti laymatishin oykida issi maccasiw iyako ehidosona. Enti asa ubbaa sinthan iyo essidi, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />“Astamaariyaw, ha maccasiya laymatishin nu oykida. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Muse higgey hanni mela maccas shuchan cadeta hayqana mela kiittees. Yaatin, neeni woygay?” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Leewe 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Zaare 22:22-24</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Enti hessa giday Yesuusa paacidi iya mootiyaba demmanaasa. Shin Yesuusi hokidi ba biradhen biitta bolla xaafis. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Enti iya zaari zaari oychidi aggonna ixin, pude dhoqu gidi, “Hinte giddon nagara oothiboonna asi koyrottidi iyo shuchan caddo” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Qassika hokidi biitta bolla xaafis.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Enti hessa si7ida wode cimatape doomidi issoy issoy keyishe wuridosona. Yesuusa xalaali he bessan eqida maccaseera attis. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />I pude dhoqu gidi maccaseeko, “Maccasete, asati aw bidonaa? Ne bolla pirdiday oonika baawee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Maccasiya, “Godaw, oonika baawa” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taanika ne bolla pirdike. Ba; zaarada nagara oothofa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Alames Poo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Qassika Yesuusi asaako, “Taani alamiyas poo7o. Tana kaalliya oonika de7o immiya poo7uwa ekanaape attishin, dhuman simeretenna” yaagidi odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Maato 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">Yoha 9:5</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Farsaaweti, “Neeni nebaa markataasa, shin ne markatethay tuma gidenna” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:31">Yoha 5:31</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani tabaa markatikoka ta markatethay tuma. Ayis giiko, taani awupe yidaako qassi aw biyako erayis, shin hinte ereketa. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Hinte asa qofan pirdeta; taani issi asa bollaka pirdike. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Taani pirdiyaba gidikoka ta pirday tuma. Ayis giiko, tana kiitida ta Aaway taara de7eesipe attishin, taani tarka de7ike. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Nam7u asa markatethi tuma gideysi hinte higgiyan xaafetis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Zaare 19:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Taani tabaa ta huuphen markatayis; qassi tana kiitida ta Aawayka tabaa markatees” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Enti, “Ne aaway awun de7ii?” yaagidi iya oychidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hinte tana woyko ta Aawa ereketa. Tana eridaba gidiyako, hinte ta Aawaka eranashin” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesuusi xoossa keethan muxaata miishiya yeggiya saaxiney de7iya bessan hessa tamaarsis. Iya qammay buroo gakiboonna gisho oonika iya oykibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Qassika Yesuusi entako, “Taani baana; hinte tana koyana, shin hinte atotethi demmonna hinte nagaran hayqana. Taani biya bessaa hinte baanaw danda7eketa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ayhude halaqati, “I, ‘Taani biya bessaa hinte baanaw danda7eketa’ yaagees. I bana barka wodhaneyee?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hinte garsafe; taani bollafe. Hinte ha alamiyape, taani ha alamiyape gidike. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Hinte atotethi demmonna hinte nagaran hayqana gada taani hintew odiday hessasa. ‘Taani Tana Gideysa’ hinte ammanonna ixiko hinte atotethi demmonna hinte nagaran hayqana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Enti, “Neeni oonee?” yaagidi oychidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani, koyrope hintew odida tana. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Taani hintebaa odada pirdiyabay darobay de7ees. Shin tana kiittidaysi tumancho; qassi taani iyape si7idaysa xalaala alamiyas odayis” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Yesuusi ba Aawaba odeysa enti akeekibokona. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Hessa gisho, Yesuusi entako, “Hinte Asa Na7aa pude dhoqu oothiya wode Taani Tana Gideysa hinte erana. Qassika taani ta maatan aykoka oothonaysanne ta Aaway tana tamaarsidaysa odeysa hinte erana. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Tana kiittidaysi taara de7ees. Taani ubba wode iya ufaysiyabaa oothiya gisho I tana ta xalaala aggibeenna” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Yesuusi hessa odishin si7ida daro asay iya ammanidosona.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tumi La77a Kessees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesuusi bana ammanida asatako, “Hinte ta timirtiyas kiitetiko tuma tana kaalleyisata. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Hinte tumaa erana; tumayka hintena aylletethafe kessana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Enti zaaridi, “Nuuni Abrahaame sheeshi; nuuni oodeska aylletibooko. Neeni woygada, ‘Hinte aylletethafe keyana’ gay?” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Maato 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luqa 3:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani hintew tuma odayis; nagara oothiya oonika nagara aylle. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Aylley merinaw soo asaara deenna, shin na7ay merinaw soo asaara de7ees. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Na7ay hintena aylletethafe kessiko hinte aylletethafe tuma keyana. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Hinte Abrahaame sheeshi gideysa taani erayis. Shin ta qaalay hinte wozanan bayna gisho, tana wodhanaw koyeeta. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Taani ta Aaway tana bessidaysa odayis, shin hinteka hinte aawape si7idaysa ootheeta” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Enti zaaridi, “Nu aaway Abrahaame” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesuusi entako, “Hinte Abrahaame nayta gidiyako I oothidaysa oothana. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Shin Xoossafe si7ida tumaa odida tana hinte wodhanaw koyeeta. Abrahaamey hessada oothibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Hinte, hinte aaway oothidaysa ootheeta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Enti zaaridi, “Nuuni tuma Xoossaa nayta; nuus issi Aaway Xoossaa xalaali de7ees” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesuusi entako, “Xoossay tuma hinte aawa gidiyako hinte tana dosana; ayis giiko, taani Xoossaa matape yada haysan de7ayis. Tana I kiittisipe attishin, taani ta maatan yabiike. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Taani geysa hinte si7anaw koyonna gisho ta giyabay hintew gelenna. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Hinte, hinte aawa Xalahe nayta. Qassi hinte, hinte aaway amotiyaba oothanaw koyeeta. I koyrope doomidi shempo wodheysa. Tumi iyan bayna gisho I tumaa ixees. Wordoy iyaw medho gidida gishonne I wordo aawa gidiya gisho wordo odetishe baape odetees. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Taani tuma odayis, shin hinte tana ammaneketa. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Hintefe, ‘Neeni nagara oothishin ta be7as’ gaanaw danda7ey oonee? Taani tuma odetiyaba gidiko tana ayis ammaneketii? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Xoossaa asi Xoossay giyaba si7ees. Hinte Xoossaa asi gidonna gisho Xoossay giyaba si7eketa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Abrahaamepe Sinthe De7ees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ayhudeti zaaridi, “ ‘Neeni Samaare asi; nenan tuna ayyaanay de7ees’ gishe like gidoko?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesuusi entako “Ta bolla tuna ayyaani baawa. Taani ta Aawa bonchayis, shin hinte tana kawusheta. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Taani ta huuphe boncho koyke; taani bonchetana mela koyeysinne taw pirdeysi de7ees. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Taani hintew tuma odayis; ta qaala naagiya oonika hayqenna” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ayhudeti zaaridi, “Ne bolla tuna ayyaanay de7eysa nuuni ha77i erida. Abrahaamey hayqis; nabetika hayqidosona. Shin neeni, ‘Ta qaala naagiya oonika hayqenna’ yaagasa. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Neeni hayqida nu aawa Abrahaamepe aadhayee? Nabetika qassi hayqidosona. Neeni nena oona gada qopay?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesuusi, “Taani tana bonchiko ta bonchoy hada. Hinte, ‘Nu Xoossaa’ giya ta Aaway I tana bonchees. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Hinte iya eronna ixiko taani iya erayis. Taani iya erike giiko hinte mela wordotayis. Shin taani iya erayis; qassi iya qaalaka naagayis. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Hinte aaway Abrahaamey ta yuussaa gallasa be7idi ufaytanaw amottis; be7idika ufaytis” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Ayhudeti zaaridi, “Hari attoshin, new ishatamu laythi kumibeenashin waanada Abrahaame be7as gay?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesuusi entako, “Taani hintew tuma odayis; Abrahaamey yeletanaape kase, ‘Taani Tana’ ” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Hessa gisho, enti Yesuusa caddanaw shuchi ekidosona. Shin Yesuusi entafe geemmidi Xoossa Keethafe keyidi bis.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Qooqe Gididi Yeletida Ura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesuusi bishe yeletoosape qooqe gididi de7iya issi addiya be7is. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Iya tamaareti, “Astamaariyaw, ha addey qooqe gididi yeletana mela nagara oothiday oonee? I oothideye woyko iya yelidaysati oothidona?” yaagidi oychidosona.<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesuusi, “Xoossaa oosoy iya bolla qoncana melape attishin, I woyko iya yelidaysati nagara oothida gisho gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Sa7i gallas de7ishin tana kiittidaysa oosuwa nu oothanaw bessees. Oonika oothanaw danda7onna qammay yees. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Taani alamiyan de7ashe alamiyas poo7o” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Maato 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoha 8:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Yesuusi hessa gidi sa7an cuttis. Ba cuchan guutha biitta laakothidi he urqan qooqe addiya ayfiya tiyis. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Yaatidi, “Bada Salihoome (Salihoome guussay Kiitetidaysa guussu) geetetiya teqetida haathan ne ayfiya meeceta” yaagis. Hessa gisho, addey bidi ba ayfiya meecetidi xeellishe simmis.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Addiya shoorotinne addey kase woossishin be7ida asay, “Haysi uttidi woossiya addiya gidenneyee?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Issi issi asay, “Haysi iya” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Harati qassi, “Akay, haysi iya daaneesipe attishin, iya gidenna” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Shin addey, “Ee, tana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Enti iyako, “Yaatin ne ayfey waanidi xeellidee?” yaagidi oychidosona.<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />I zaaridi, “Yesuusa geetetiya addey guutha urqa laakothidi ta ayfiya tiyidi, ‘Salihoome bada ne ayfiya meeceta’ yaagin, taani bada meecetada xeella aggas” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Enti iyako, “I awun de7ii?” yaagidi oychidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Addey, “Taani erike” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Enti kase qooqe, shin ha77i xeellida addiya Farsaawetako efidosona. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Yesuusi urqa laakothidi addiya ayfiya pathida gallasay Sambaata gallas. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Hessa gisho, addey waanidi xeellidaako Farsaaweti iya zaari oychidosona. Addey entako, “I ta ayfiyan guutha urqa tiyis. Ta ayfiya meecetada ha77i xeellayis” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Farsaawetepe issoti issoti, “Haysa oothida addey Sambaata higgiya naagonna gisho Xoossaa matape yibeenna” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Shin harati, “Nagarancho asi haysa mela malaata waati oothanaw danda7ii?” yaagidi banta giddon shaaketidosona.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Hessa gisho, Farsaaweti addiyako, “I ne ayfiya xeelisida gisho ne iyabaa woygay?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Addey, “I nabe” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Ayhude halaqati, iya aayiwunne aawa xeegidi oychana gakanaw, addey kase qooqe gididaysanne ha77i I xeelleysa ammanibookona. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Enti iya aayiwunne iya aawako, “Hinte ‘Qooqe gididi yeletis’ giya hinte na7ay haysee? Yaatin, ha77i waanidi xeellidee?” yaagidi oychidosona.<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Iya yelidaysati, “Haysi nu na7aa gididaysanne qooqe gididi I yeletidaysa nu eroos. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Shin ha77i I waanidi xeellidaako qassi iya ayfiya ooni pathidaako nuuni eroko. Iya oychite. I bana erida asi gidiya gisho babaa odanaw danda7ees” yaagidosona. <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Iya yelidaysati hessa giday Ayhudetas yayyida gishosa. Ayis giiko, Ayhudeti, Yesuusi I Kiristoosa yaagidi markatiya asi de7iko he uraa ayhude woosa keethafe hilanaw koyrottidi zore qachidosona. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Iya yelidaysati, “I bana erida asi; iya oychite” yaagiday hessasa.<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Hessa gisho, qooqe gididi yeletida addiya enti zaari xeegidi, “Tumaa odanaw Xoossan caaqa; ha addey nagarancho gideysa nu eroos” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Addey zaaridi, “I nagarancho gideysa, ta erike. Taani qooqe gideysanne ha77i xeelleysa he issiba erayis” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Enti zaaridi, “I new ay oothidee? I ne ayfiya waati pathidee?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />I entako, “Taani hintew odas, shin si7ibeeketa. Ayis zaari si7anaw koyeetii? Hinteka iya tamaare gidanaw koyeetiyee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Enti iya cayidi, “Ne he uraa tamaare gida; nuuni Muse tamaare. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Xoossay Muses odidaysa nuuni eroos, shin hari attoshin ha uray I awupe yidaakoka nu eroko” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Addey entako, “I awupe yidaako hinte eronnaysi malaalsiyaba, shin I ta ayfiya pathis. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Xoossaa boncheysanne I koyaba oothiya uraa Xoossay si7eesipe attishin, nagaranchota si7enna. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Saloy sa7i medhetoosape qooqe gididi yeletida asa ayfe pathiday oonika baawa. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ha addey Xoossafe kiitetiboonaba gidiyako issibaaka oothanaw danda7enna” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Enti zaaridi, “Neeni nagaran yeletada diccidaysi nuna tamaarsanaw koyay?” yaagidosona. Iya ayhude woosa keethafe hilidosona.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wozana Qooqetethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesuusi enti addiya kessidaysa si7ida wode iya demmidi, “Asa Na7aa ammanay?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Addey Yesuusako, “Godaw, taani iya ammanana mela I oonee? Taw odarkii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesuusi addiyako, “Neeni iya be7adasa; ha neera odeteysi iya” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Addey zaaridi, “Godaw, ammanayis” yaagidi Yesuusas goyinnis.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesuusi, “Qooqeti xeellana melanne xeelleysati qooqana mela taani pirdanaw ha alamiya yas” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Iyara de7iya guutha Farsaaweti hessa si7idi, “Nu qooqeyee?” yaagidi oychidosona.<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesuusi, “Hinte qooqe gidiyako hintew nagara gidenna. Shin ha77i hinte xeelloos giya gisho hinte, hinte nagaran de7eeta” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Lo77o Henthancho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesuusi, “Taani hintew tuma odayis; dorsa girbe giddo pengera gidonna harasoora geliya oonika kaysonne panga. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Shin pengera geleysi dorsata heemmeysa. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Pengiya naageysi iyaw pengiya dooyees; dorsatika iya qaala si7oosona. I ba dorsata enta sunthan sunthan xeegees; enta kaalethidi kare kessees. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />I ba dorsata kare kessidaape guye enta sinthan hemetees. Enti iya qaala eriya gisho iya kaalloosona. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Hara uraa qaala enti eronna gisho iyape baqatoosonape attishin, iya geedo kaallokona” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesuusi entaw ha leemisuwa odis, shin I ay gidaako enti akeekibokona.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Zaaridi Yesuusi entako, “Taani hintew tuma odayis; taani dorsatas penge. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Taape sinthe yida ubbay kaysonne panga, shin dorsati enta si7ibookona. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Pengey tana; ta baggara geliya oonika attana. I ta baggara gelananne keyana; lo77o heemetiya bessi demmana. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Kaysoy kaysotanaw, shukanawunne dhaysanaw yeesipe attishin, harabas yeenna. Taani entaw de7oy daana melanne kumidi palahana mela yas.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Taani lo77o henthancho; lo77o henthanchoy ba dorsata gisho ba shempuwa aathidi immees. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Une heemmiya asi dorsata godanne henthancho gidonna gisho suudhumey yaa wode be7idi dorsata aggidi bees. Hessa gisho, suudhumey dorsata oykidi laallees. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Une heemmeysi miishes heemmiya gishonne dorsatabay iya qofisonna gisho dorsata aggidi baqatees.<verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15" />“Taani lo77o henthancho. Ta Aaway tana ereysada taanika ta Aawa erayis. Hessadaka, taani ta dorsata erayis; ta dorsatika tana eroosona. Taani ta dorsata gisho ta shempuwa aatha immayis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Maato 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luqa 10:22</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Ha wudiyan bayna hara dorsati taw de7oosona. Taani entaka ehanaw bessees. Enti ta qaala si7ana; enti issi wude gidana; henthanchoyka issuwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Taani ta shempuwa aatha immada zaara ekiya gisho ta Aaway tana dosees. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Ta dosada ta shempuwa aatha immaysipe attishin, taape oonika ekenna. Taani ta shempuwa aatha immanawunne zaara ekanaw maati taw de7ees. Taani oothana mela ta Aaway tana kiittidaysi haysa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Hessa I gida gisho, Ayhudeta giddon qassika shaaketethi medhetis. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Entafe dariya baggay, “Iyan tuna ayyaanay de7ees! I gooyees! I giyaba ayis si7eetii?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Harati qassi, “Xalahey oykida asi haysada odetenna. Tuna ayyaani qooqe ayfe xeelisanaw danda7iyee?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Asa Na7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Yerusalaamen Xoossa Keetha anjisida gallasata bonchiya ba7aaley gakis; he wode sa7i balgo. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesuusi xoossa keethan Solomone barandan simeretees. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Ayhudeti Yesuusa yuushon shiiqi eqidi, “Neeni nuna awude gakanaw sidhera wothanee? Neeni Kiristoosa gidiko ane nuus geeshshada oda” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesuusi zaaridi entako, “Taani hintew odas; shin tana ammaneketa. Taani ta Aaway taw immida maatan oothiya oosoy tabaa markatees. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Shin taani hintew odidaysada hinte ta dorse gidonna gisho ammaneketa. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ta dorsati ta qaala si7oosona. Taani enta erayis; entika tana kaalloosona. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Taani entaw merinaa de7uwa immayis; enti ubbaraka dhayokona. Oonika ta kushepe enta bonqi ekanaw danda7enna. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Enta taw immida ta Aaway ubbaafe aadhees<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ta Aaway ubbaafe aadhees: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi beni maxaafati, “Ta Aaway taw immida enti ubbaafe aadhosona” yaagosona.</char></note> Oonika ta Aawa kushepe enta bonqi ekanaw danda7enna. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Tanne ta Aaway issino” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Ayhudeti Yesuusa caddanaw qassika shuchi denthidosona. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesuusi entako, “Taani oothana mela ta Aaway taw immida daro lo77o oosota hintena ootha bessaas. Hessatape awusa gisho tana shuchan caddanaw koyeetii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Ayhudeti zaaridi, “Nuuni nena ne lo77o ooso gisho shuchan caddanaw koyoko. Shin neeni Xoossaa cayiya gishonne ase gidashe neeni, nena Xoosse giya gishosa” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Leewe 24:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Geeshsha Maxaafan Xoossay, ‘Hinte xoossata’ gidaysi xaafetibeennee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Maz 82:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Geeshsha Maxaafay merinaw laametenna. Xoossay ba qaala immida asata, ‘xoossata’ gidi xeegiko, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Aaway dooridi ha alamiya kiitida tana Xoossaa Na7a waatidi ‘Xoossaa cayaasa’ yaagetii? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Taani ta Aaway ootheysa oothonna ixiko tana ammanopite. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Shin taani oothiyaba gidiko hinte tana ammanonna ixikoka, ta Aaway tanan de7eysanne taka ta Aawan de7eysa hinte erana mela ta oosuwa ammanite” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Qassika enti iya oykanaw koydosona, shin I entafe kessi ekis.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yohaanisi kase xammaqiya bessaa, Yordaanose Shaafape hefinthi Yesuusi pinnidi yan de7is.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:28">Yoha 1:28</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Daro asay Yesuusako yidi, “Yohaanisi malaata oothibeenna, shin I ha addiyaba odidabay ubbay tuma” yaagidosona. <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Yan daro asay Yesuusa ammanidosona.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Alaazara Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Bitaane gutan Alaazara geetetiya issi addey hargetis. Bitaaney Mayraamanne I michiya Marta de7iya guta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:38-39">Luqa 10:38-39</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />He Mayraama Godaa tohuwa shitto tiyada ba binaanan iya tohuwa quchidaaro. Hargetiday I ishaa Alaazara.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yoha 12:3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Hessa gisho, micheti, “Godaw, ne doseysi hargetis” gidi Yesuusako kiittidosona.<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesuusi hessa si7ida wode, “Ha hargey, Xoossaynne iya Na7ay bonchetana melape attishin, hayqos gathiya harge gidenna” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesuusi Marta, I michiwunne Alaazara dosees. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Shin Alaazari hargidaysa Yesuusi si7idi ba de7iya bessan nam7u gallas gam7is. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Hessafe guye, Yesuusi ba tamaaretako, “Zaaridi Yihuda biitta boos” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Iya tamaareti zaaridi, “Astamaariyaw, guutha wodepe kase Ayhudeti nena shuchan caddidi wodhanaw koydosona; ha77ika yaa baanee?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesuusi, “Issi gallasan tammanne nam7u saatey de7ees gidenneyee? Gallas hemetiya asi ha alamiya poo7uwa be7iya gisho dhubetenna. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Shin qamma hemetiya oonika poo7oy bayna gisho, dhubetees” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesuusi hessa gidaape guye entako, “Nu dosiya Alaazari dhiskis, shin iya denthanaw taani baana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Iya tamaareti zaaridi, “Godaw, I dhiskidaba gidiko iyaw lo77ana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesuusi Alaazari hayqidaysa odis, shin entaw coo dhisko daanis. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Hessa gisho, Yesuusi geeshshidi entako, “Alaazari hayqis. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Hinte ammanana mela taani he bessan de7onaysas hinte gisho ufaytayis. Ane yedhite; iyako boos” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Hessafe guye, Didimoosa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Didimoosa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay mente guussu.</char></note> geetetiya Toomasi ba lagge tamaaretako, “Astamaariyara hayqanaw nuka boos” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Dendonne De7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesuusi gakiya wode Alaazari moogetin oyddu gallas gidis. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Bitaaney Yerusalaamepe heedzu kilo mitire mela haakees. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Daro Ayhudeti Martanne Mayraamo enta ishay hayqidaysas minthethanaw yidosona.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Marta Yesuusi yidaysa si7ada iya mokanaw keyasu, shin Mayraama son attasu. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marta Yesuusako, “Godaw, neeni haysan de7idaba gidiyako ta ishay hayqennashin. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Shin ha77i gidikoka neeni woossiyaba Xoossay new immanaysa taani erayis” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesuusi, “Ne ishay hayqope dendana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Marta iyako, “Wursetha gallas I hayqope dendanaysa erayis” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesuusi iiko, “Taani dendonne de7o; tana ammaniya oonika hayqikoka de7on daana. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Qassi de7on de7eynne tana ammaniya oonika hayqenna. Hessa neeni ammanay?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Marta zaarada, “Godaw, ee taani ammanayis! Neeni Xoossaa Na7aa, alamiya yaanaw de7iya Kiristoosa gideysa taani ammanayis” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Marta hessa gidaape guye, bada ba michiw geeman xeegada, “Astamaarey yidi nena koyees” yaagasu. <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Mayraama hessa si7ida wode ellesa denda eqada Yesuusako basu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />He saaten Yesuusi Martara gahetida bessan de7ees; buroo gutaa gakibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Mayraamo minthethishe iira son de7iya Ayhudeti, iya denda eqada ellesada kare keydaysa be7idi, duufo bada yeekanaw haniya daanin iyo kaallidi keyidosona.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mayraama Yesuusi de7iyasuwa bada iya be7ida wode iya tohuwa bolla kundada, “Godaw, neeni haysan de7idaba gidiyako ta ishay hayqennashin” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesuusi Mayraamanne iira de7iya, Ayhudeti yeekeysa be7idi, ba wozanan daro seeletidi, <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />“Awun moogidetii?” yaagidi oychin, “Godaw, yada be7a” yaagidi zaaridosona.<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesuusi afuxis. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Hessa gisho, Ayhudeti, “I Alaazara ay mela dosiyako be7ite” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Shin entafe issoti issoti, “Haysi qooqiya xeelisidaysi ha addey hayqonna mela oothanaw danda7eneshin?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alaazari Hayqope Denduwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Qassika Yesuusi seeletidi, Alaazari moogetida duufuwa bis. He duufoy shuchan gordetida gongolo. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesuusi, “Shuchaa denthite” yaagidi kiittis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Marta, “Godaw, I hayqosaape oyddu gallas gidida gisho, ha77i xinqana” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesuusi Martako, “Ne ammaniyaba gidiko Xoossaa bonchuwa be7anaysa taani new odabikina?” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Enti shucha denthin Yesuusi salo pude xeellidi, “Aawaw, tana ne si7ida gisho nena galatayis. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ne ubba wode tana si7eysa taani erayis. Shin haysan eqida asay neeni tana kiittidaysa ammanana mela taani enta gisho haysa gayis” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Yesuusi hessa gidaape guye, ba qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Alaazara, haa keya!” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Hayqida addey ziidhetida mela kusheynne tohoy shalon qashetidi de7ishin iya ayfey karey goozetida mela duufuwape keyis. Yesuusi enta, “Birshite, bo giite!” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosa Bolla Maqetidosona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Maato 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luqa 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Hessa gisho, Mayraamiko yida Ayhudetape daroti Yesuusi oothidaysa be7idi iya ammanidosona. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Shin entafe issoti issoti Farsaawetako bidi Yesuusi oothidaysa entaw odidosona. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Hessafe guye, kahine halaqatinne Farsaaweti shanguwa shiishidi, “Ha addey daro malaatata oothiya gisho nu ay oothinoo? <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Nuuni iya si77i gidi aggiko asa ubbay iya ammanana. Qassi Roome biitta asati yidi nu xoossa keethaanne nu deriya dhaysana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Entafe issoy Qayyaafa geysi, he laythi kahine halaqa gididaysi, “Hinte aykoka ereketa! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Asa ubbay dhayeysafe asa ubbaa gisho issi asi hayqeysi lo77o gideysa ereketii?” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />I hessa baape gibeenna. Shin he laythi kahine halaqa gidiya gisho, Yesuusi Ayhude asaa gisho hayqanaw besseysa tinbite odis. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Qassi Yesuusi Ayhude asaa xalaalas gidonashin laaletidi de7iya Xoossaa asa ubbaa issife shiishanawunne issi asi oothanaw hayqana.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />He gallasape doomidi enti iya wodhanaw maqetidosona. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Hessa gisho, Yesuusi Ayhudeta giddon qoncen simeretibeenna. Shin mela biitta matan de7iya Efreema gutaa bis. Ba tamaaretara he bessan gam7is.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ayhudeti bonchiya Paasika gallasay matis. Qassi daro asay bantana geeshshanaw Paasika bonchiya gallasay gakanaape sinthe he biittafe Yerusalaame bidosona. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Enti xoossa keethan eqidi Yesuusa yuussaa naagiya gisho, “Ay qopeetii? Yesuusi baaliya bonchanaw yeennee?” yaagidi issoy issuwa oychidosona. <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Kahine halaqatinne Farsaaweti Yesuusa oykanaw, I de7iyasuwa eriya oonika bantaw odana mela kiittidosona.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Shitto Tiyida Maccasiw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Maato 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Paasika bonchiya gallasape usupun gallas sinthatidi, Yesuusi hayqope denthida Alaazari de7iya gutaa, Bitaane bis. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />He bessan enti iyaw kaho giigisidosona. Alaazari Yesuusara issife gayta bolla uttidashin, Marti entana imatawusu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Mayraama nardoose geetetiya daro al7o geeshsha shitto ehada Yesuusa tohuwa tiyasu. Ba binaanan iya tohuwa quchasu; keetha ubbay shitto sawon tonku gis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luqa 7:37-38</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Shin Yesuusa tamaaretape issoy, Yesuusa aathidi immanaysi, Asqoroota Yihuda, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Ayis ha shittoy heedzu xeetu dinaaren bayzetidi, miishey manqotas imetennee?” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />I kayso gidida gisho hessa gisipe attishin, manqotas qadhetidi gibeenna. I miishe karxiita oykeysa gidiya gisho ubba wode iyape baw ekees.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yesuusi, “Iya baw de7iyaba ta moogo gallasaas minjida gisho iyo aggaagite. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Manqoti ubba wode hintera daana, shin taani ubba wode hintera de7ike” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Zaare 15:11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />He wode daro asay Yesuusi Bitaanen de7eysa si7idi yaa bidosona. Enti Yesuusa xalaala gidonashin, I hayqope denthida Alaazaraka be7anaw bidosona. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Hessa gisho, kahine halaqati Alaazaraka qassi wodhanaw maqetidosona. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Ayis giiko, Alaazara gaason daro Ayhudeti entana ixidi Yesuusa ammanoosona.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gita Bonchon Yerusalaame Geluwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Maato 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luqa 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Wontetha gallas Paasika bonchiya bessaa yida daro asay Yesuusi Yerusalaame beysa si7idi, <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Zamba haythi ekidi iya mokanaw keyidosona. Banta qaala dhoqu oothidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Hosaana! Xoossay galatetto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:13">Godaa sunthan yeysi anjeto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:13">Xoossay Isra7eele Kawa anjo!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:13">yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Maz 118:25-26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14-15" />Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:14-15">“Xiyoone katamaw, babofa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:14-15">Heko, ne Kawoy hare mara bolla uttidi yees”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:14-15">geetetidayada Yesuusi hare mari demmidi iya toggis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zaka 9:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Yesuusa tamaareti hessa kase akeekibokona. Shin Yesuusi bonchetidaape guye enti hessa ubbaa akeekidosona. Hessi ubbay Geeshsha Maxaafay gidaysada hanis.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Yesuusi Alaazara duufope xeegidi, hayqope denthida wode iyara de7iya daro asay Yesuusaba markatidosona. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Daro asay iya mokanaw keyday, I he malaatata oothidaysa si7ida gishosa. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Hessa gisho, Farsaaweti issoy issuwako, “Nu aykoka oothanaw danda7onnaysa be7ite; dere ubbay iya kaallees” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Paasika bonchiya gallas goyinnanaw Yerusalaame bidaysata giddon issi issi Girike asati de7oosona. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Enti Galila biittan Beetesayda katamaape yida Filphoosako bidi, “Godaw, nuuni Yesuusa be7anaw koyoos” yaagidi woossidosona. <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filphoosi bidi Indiriyasas odin nam7ay bidi, Yesuusas odidosona.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesuusi entako, “Asa Na7ay, bonchetiya wodey gakis. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Taani hintew tuma odayis; issi giste ayfey biittan wodhidi wooqonna ixiko barka attees. Shin he giste ayfey wooqiko daro ayfe ayfees. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Ba shempuwa dosiya oonika dhaysees; ba shempuwa ha alamiyan ixiya oonika merinaa de7os ashshees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Maato 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luqa 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Taani de7iyasuwan taara daana mela taw oothanaw koyiya oonika tana kaallanaw bessees. Taw oothiya oonaka ta Aaway bonchana.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Ha77i ta shempoy daro un7etis; yaatin woygo? ‘Ta Aawaw, tana ha saatepe ashsharki’ yaago? Akay, taani yiday waaye ekanaasa. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Ta Aawaw, ne sunthaa boncha” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">He wode salope, “Taani ta sunthaa bonchas; zaaradaka bonchana” giya qaalay yis.<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />He bessan eqida daro asay he qaala si7idi, “Hessi dada” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:29">Harati qassi, “Kiitanchoy iyaw odis” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yesuusi zaaridi entako, “Ha qaalay hinte gisho yisipe attishin, ta gisho gidenna. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Ha alamey pirdetiya wodey ha77i; ha alamiya haareysi ha77i kare holetana. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Qassi taani sa7ape dhoqu oosetida wode asa ubbaa taako ehana” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />I hessa giday ay mela hayqo hayqaneko entaw qoncisanaasa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Daro asay zaaridi, “Nu higgey Kiristoosi merinaw de7eysa odees. Yaatin, neeni woygada, ‘Asa Na7ay dhoqu gaanaw bessees’ gay? ‘I, Asa Na7ay oonee?’ ” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Daane 7:14</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesuusi, “Poo7oy hintera guutha wode gam7ana. Hintew dhumonna mela poo7oy de7ishin, poo7uwan hemetite. Dhuman hemetiya asi aw biyako erenna. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Poo7o nayta gidana mela poo7oy de7ishin poo7uwa ammanite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesuusi hessa odetidaape guye bidi entafe geemmis. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />I hessa mela malaatata enta sinthan oothinka ammanibookona. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Nabiya Isayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Godaw, nu markatethaa ooni ammanidee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Goday ba wolqaa ooddes qoncisidee?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:38">Gidaysi tuma gidana mela enti iya ammanibookona.<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39-40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39-40" />Qassika Isayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:39-40">“Enta ayfey xeellonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">enta wozanay akeekona mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">enti Xoossaako simmin, I enta pathonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:39-40">Xoossay enta ayfiya qooqisis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:39-40">Enta wozanaa minthis”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:39-40">gida gisho enti ammananaw danda7ibookona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa 6:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:39-40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isayaasi hessa giday, Yesuusa bonchuwa be7ida gishonne iyabaa odida gishosa.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Gidikoka, Ayhudeta halaqatapeka daroti Yesuusa ammanidosona. Shin Farsaaweti bantana Ayhudeta Woosa Keethafe kessoosona gidi yayyida gisho ammanida gidi qoncen markatibookona. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Hessa enti oothiday, Xoossan eretanaysafe aathidi asan eretanaysa dosida gishosa.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesuusi ba qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Tana ammaniya oonika tana kiittidaysaka ammaneesipe attishin, ta xalaala ammanena. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Tana be7iya oonika tana kiittidaysaka be7ees. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Tana ammaniya ubbay dhuman doonna mela taani poo7o gidada alamiya yas. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Ta qaala si7idi kiitetonna oonaka taani pirdike. Ayis giiko, taani alamiya ashshanaw yasipe attishin, pirdanaw yabiike. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Tana ixeysanne ta qaala ekonna oonaka pirdeysi de7ees. Taani odida qaalay wursetha gallas he uraa pirdana. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ayis giiko, taani hessa taape odike, shin tana kiitida ta Aaway taani gaanaysanne odanaysa kiittis. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Qassi iya kiitay merinaa de7o gideysa taani erayis. Hessa gisho, taani odeysi ta Aaway tana oda gidaysa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Ba Tamaareta Toho Meecis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Paasika bonchiya gallasay gakanaape sinthatidi ha alamiya aggidi Aawako biya wodey gakidaysa Yesuusi eris. Ha alamiyan de7iya ba asaa ubba wode dosis; wursethi gakanawuka enta dosis.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesuusaranne iya tamaaretara issife kaho moosona. Hessafe kase Xalahey Simoona na7aa Asqoroota Yihudi Yesuusa aathidi immanaada iya wozanan iita qofa wothis. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesuusi Aaway ubbaba iya kushen wothidaysa, I Xoossaa matape yidaysanne simmidi iyako baanaysa eris. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Yesuusi gayta bollafe dendidi bolla bagga ma7uwa qaari wothidi, pooxa ekidi ba xeessan marxafis. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Hessafe guye, haathe meecha miishen tigidi, ba tamaareta tohuwa meeccis; qassi ba xeessan dancida pooxan quchis.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Yesuusi Simoona Phexroosako yaa wode Phexroosi, “Godaw, ne ta tohuwa meeccanee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesuusi zaaridi iyako, “Taani ootheysa ne ha77i eraka, shin guyepe akeekana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Yaatin, Phexroosi, “Ne ta tohuwa ubbaraka meeccaka” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesuusi iyako, “Taani ne tohuwa meecconna ixiko newunne tawunne issifetethi baawa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Phexroosi Yesuusako, “Godaw, yaatiko, ta tohuwa xalaala gidonashin ta kushiyanne ta huuphiya meecca” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Bolla meecetida oonika tohope haraba meecetanaw koshshenna; iyaw ubbasoy geeshshi. Hinte geeshshi, shin ubbay geeshshi gideketa” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesuusi bana aathidi immana uray ooneko eriya gisho, “Hinte ubbay geeshshi gideketa” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Enta tohuwa meeccidaape guye, Yesuusi ba ma7uwa zaari ma7is. Simmi gayta bolla uttidi entako, “Taani hintew oothidaysa akeeketii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luqa 22:27</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Hinte tana astamaarenne Godaa geeta; taani hinte geysa gidiya gisho lo77o gideta. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Taani hintew Godanne astamaare gidashe hinte tohuwa meecciko hinteka issoy issuwas hessada oothanaw bessees. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Hiza, taani hintew oothidaysada hinteka oothana mela hintew leemiso gidas. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Taani hintew tuma odayis; aylley ba godaape, kiitetidaysi kiittidaysafe aadhenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Maato 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luqa 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Yoha 15:20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Hinte hessa eridi oothiyaba gidiko anjetidaysata.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Taani hintena ubbaa giike; taani dooridaysata erayis. Shin Geeshsha Maxaafan, ‘Ta barsidaysi ta kushiya saxis’ geetetidaysi tuma gidanaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz 41:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />‘Taani Tana Gideysa’ hinte ammanana mela hessi hananaape sinthatada hintew odayis. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Taani hintew tuma odayis; taani kiitida oonaka mokiya uray tana mokees. Tana mokiya oonika tana kiittidaysa mokees” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Maato 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luqa 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Aathidi Immana Ura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Maato 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mar 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luqa 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesuusi hessa odidaape guye, ba wozanan daro un7etidi, “Taani hintew tuma odayis; tana hintefe issoy aathidi immana” gidi qoncisidi odis.<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />I oodeba odiyako iya tamaaretas eretonna ixin issoy issuwa xeellidosona. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Iya tamaaretape issoy, Yesuusi doseysi, Yesuusa matan uttis. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Hessa gisho, Simoon Phexroosi iya qam7otidi, “I oona giyako ane oycha” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Hessa gisho, he tamaarey Yesuusako shiiqidi haythan, “Godaw, I oonee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani uythaa woxen tushada barseysa” yaagis. Qassi uythaa menthi ekidi, woxen tushidi, Simoona na7aa Asqoroota Yihuda barsis. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yihudi uythaa baaridaape guye, Xalahey ellesidi Yihudan gelis. Yesuusi iyako, “Neeni oothanaw qopidaba ellesada ootha” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Shin gayta bolla uttidaysatape oonika Yesuusi hessa ayis iyako gidaako eribeenna. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Yihudi miishe oykiya gisho, iya tamaaretape issoti issoti Yesuusi iya, “Paasika bonchiya gallasaas bantaw koshshiyaba shamma woyko manqotas muxaata imma gis” yaagidi qopidosona.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yihudi uythaa baarida mela ellesidi kare keyis. He wode sa7i qamma.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexroosi Yesuusa Kaddanaysi Odetis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yihudi kare keydaape guye, Yesuusi, “Ha77i Asa Na7ay bonchetis; Xoossayka iya baggara bonchetis. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Xoossay iya baggara bonchetiko I ba huuphen Asa Na7aa bonchana; qassi I hessa ellesidi oothana. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Ta nayto, taani hintera daro wode gam7ike. Hinte tana koyana, shin taani Ayhudetas odidaysa mela, ‘Hinte taani biya bessaa baanaw danda7eketa.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Yoha 7:34</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Taani hintew immiya ooratha kiitay haysa; issoy issuwa dosite. Taani hintena dosidaysada hinte issoy issuwa dosanaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Yoha 15:12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Yoha 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Yoha 5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Hinte issoy issuwara dosetiko hinte ta tamaare gideysa asa ubbay erana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoon Phexroosi Yesuusako, “Godaw, neeni aw bay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani biya bessaa neeni ha77i kaallanaw danda7aka, shin guyepe tana kaallana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Phexroosi, “Godaw, taani nena ha77i kaallanaw ayis danda7ikina? Taani ne gisho, hayqanawuka giiga uttas” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ta gisho hayqanaw tuma giiga uttadii? Taani new tuma odayis; kuttoy waassanaape sinthe neeni tana heedzu toho kaddana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Aawako Efiya Oge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesuusi ba tamaaretako, “Hinte wozanay un7etofo, Xoossaa ammanite, tanaka ammanite. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Ta Aawa keethan daro bessi de7ees. Taani hintew besse giigisanaw bayis. Hessa gidonnaako taani hintew odikeshin. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Taani bada besse giigisidaape guye, taani de7iyasuwan hinte daana mela simma yada hintena taako efana. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Hinte taani biya bessaa efiya ogiya ereeta” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Yaatin, Toomasi, “Godaw, neeni biya bessaa nuuni eroko; ogiya waatidi eranaw danda7anee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ogey, tumaynne de7oy tana. Ta baggara gidonna ixiko oonika ta Aawako baanaw danda7enna. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Hinte tana eriyaba gidiyako, ta Aawaka erana. Shin hizape doomidi hinte iya ereetanne iya be7ideta” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filphoosi Yesuusako, “Godaw, Aawa nuna bessa; hessi nuus gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani haysa mela wode hintera de7inka tana erikii? Tana be7ida uray Aawaka be7is. Yaatin, neeni woygada, ‘Aawa nuna bessa’ gay? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Taani Aawara issino gideysanne Aawayka taara issino gideysa neeni ammanikiyee? Taani hintew odiya qaala taani taape odike, shin tanan de7iya Aaway ba oosuwa oothees. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Taani Aawan de7eysanne Aawayka tanan de7eysa ammanite. Hessa ammanonna ixiko ta oothiyabatan tana ammanite.<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />“Taani hintew tuma odayis; tana ammaniya uray taani oothiya oosuwape aadhiya ooso oothana. Taani Aawako biya gisho tana ammaniya oonika haysafe aadhiya ooso oothana. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Aaway Na7aa baggara bonchetana mela ta sunthan hinte woossiya ubbaa ta hintew oothana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Ta sunthan aybibaaka hinte oychiko ta hintew oothana.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Qaala Gelida Geeshsha Ayyaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Hinte tana dosiko ta kiitaa naagana. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Taani Aawa woossana; hintera merinaw daana mela minthetheysa hintew immana. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />He Ayyaanay Xoossaa tumaa qoncisees. Ha alamiya asay iya be7onna gishonne eronna gisho iya ekanaw danda7okona. Shin I hintera de7iya gishonne hinte giddon daana gisho hinte iya ereeta.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Taani hintena aayiya aawu bayna na7ada hinte xalaala aggike; simmada hinteko yaana. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Guutha wodepe guye alamey tana zaari be7enna, shin hinte be7ana. Taani de7on de7iya gisho hinteka de7on de7ana. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Taani ta Aawan, hinte tanan, qassi taani hintenan de7eysa hinte he gallas erana.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Ta kiitaa ekidi naagey tana dosees. Tana doseysa ta Aawayka dosees; taanika iya dosayis; taani iyaw qoncana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Asqoroota Yihuda gidonna Yihudi Yesuusako, “Godaw, neeni waatada alamiyas gidonashin nuus nena qoncisanee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Tana dosiya oonika ta qaalas kiitetana. Ta Aaway iya dosana. Qassi ta Aawaynne taani iyako yidi iyara daana. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Tana dosonna oonika ta qaalas kiitetenna. Hinte si7iya qaalay tana kiitida Aawabape attishin, tabaa gidenna.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Taani hintera ha77i de7ashe hessa hintew odas. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Shin Aaway ta sunthan kiittana minthethiya Geeshsha Ayyaanay, hintena ubbaba tamaarsana. Taani hintew odida ubbaa I hintena hassayisana.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Sarotethaa hintew immana. Taani ta sarotethaa hintew immana. Ta immiya sarotethay alamey immiya sarotethaa mela gidenna. Hessa gisho, un7etofite, yayyofite. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />‘Taani baana, shin simmada hinteko yaana’ gidaysa si7ideta. Hinte tana tuma dosiyaba gidiyako ta Aaway taape aadhiya gisho taani iyako beysan hinte ufaytana. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Hessi haniya wode hinte ammanana mela hessi hanonna de7ishin sinthatada taani hintew odas.<verse eid="JHN 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />“Ha alamiya haareysi yaa gisho hizape guye hintera daro odetike. Tana I aykoka oothanaw danda7enna. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Shin taani Aawa doseysa alamey erana mela ta Aaway tana kiittidaysa ubbaa oothayis. Dendite; haysafe boos.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Woyne Ubbanne Tasheta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Taani tuma woyne ubba. Goshshanchoy ta Aawa. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />I, ta bolla de7iya ayfe ayfonna tashiya ubbaa karees. Ayfiya tashiya kasepe aadhidi ayfana mela he tashiya I giigisana. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Taani hintew odida qaala gisho hinte geeshshi. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Tanan de7ite; taanika hintenan de7ana. Woyne tashey ubbara doona ixiko he tashey barka ayfe ayfanaw danda7enna. Hessadaka, hinteka tanan de7onna ixiko ayfe ayfanaw danda7eketa.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Taani woyne ubba; hinte tasheta. Tanan de7eysinne taani iyan de7eysi, I daro ayfe ayfana. Ta bayna hinte xalaala aykoka oothanaw danda7eketa. <figure style="fig" alt="Grape vine on trellis" file="HK00112B.tif" size="span" ref="15:5">Woyne Mithinne Iya Ayfiya</figure> <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Tanan doonna uray tashiyada karen yegitidi melana. Hessa mela tasheti shiiqidi taman yegetana, xuugetana. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Hinte tanan de7iko, ta qaalayka hintenan de7iko, hinte koyiyabay ayba gidikoka woossite; hinte ekana. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Hinte daro ayfe ayfiya ta tamaare gidiko, hessan ta Aaway bonchetana. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Aaway tana doseysada taanika hintena dosayis; ta siiquwan de7ite. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Taani ta Aawa kiitaa naagada iya siiquwan de7idaysada hinteka ta kiitaa naagiko ta siiquwan daana.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Ta ufaysay hintenan gidana melanne hinte ufaysay polo gidana mela taani hintew hessa odas. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Ta kiitay haysa; taani hintena dosidaysada hinteka issoy issuwa dosite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yoha 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Yoha 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:5">Yihu 5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Ba shempuwa ba laggiyas aathidi immeysafe aadhiya gita siiqoy baawa. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Taani hintena kiittidaba ubbaa oothiko hinte dosetidaysata.<verse eid="JHN 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />“Aylley ba goday oothiyaba eronna gisho taani hintena hizape guye aylleta giike. Shin ta Aawape si7ida ubbaa taani hintew odida gisho hintena dosetidaysata gas. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Taani hintena doorasipe attishin, hinte tana dooribeketa. Hinte bidi dhayonna ayfe ayfana mela taani hintena shuumas. Yaaniko, ta Aaway hinte ta sunthan woossidaba ubbaa immana. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ta kiitay haysa: issoy issuwa dosite.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alamey Yesuusa Tamaareta Ixana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Alamey hintena ixiko koyrottidi tana ixidaysa akeekite. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Hinte alamiyaba gidiyako alamey hintena dosana. Shin taani hintena alamepe doorida gishonne hinte alamiyaba gidonna gisho alamey hintena ixees. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />‘Aylley ba godaape aadhenna’ gada taani hintew odidaysa akeekite. Enti tana gooddidaba gidiko hintenaka gooddana. Enti ta qaala naagidaba gidiko hinte qaalaka naagana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Maato 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luqa 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yoha 13:16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Shin enti tana kiittidaysa eronna gisho ha ubbaa ta gaason hinte bolla oothana. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Taani yada entaw odonnaba gidiyako nagara gidenna. Shin ha77i enti oothida nagaraas gaasoyabay baawa. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Tana ixeysi ta Aawaka ixees. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Oonika oothiboonna ooso ta enta giddon oothaboonnaba gidiyako entaw nagara gidonna attana. Shin ha77i enti taani oothida oosuwa be7idi tanaka ta Aawaka ixidosona. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Shin enta higgiyan, ‘Tana coo ixidosona’ geetetidi xaafetidaysi poletana mela hessi hanis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Maz 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Aawape yaa tumaa qoncisiya Ayyaana ta hintew kiittana. I hintena minthethana, tabaa markatana. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Hinteka koyrope doomidi taara de7iya gisho tabaa markatana.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Taani hessa hinte ammanoy dhayonna mela hintew odas. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Enti hintena ayhude woosa keethatape kessi yeddana. Hessadaka, hintena wodhiya oonika Xoossi koyaba oothiya daaniya wodey yaana. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Enti hessa hinte bolla oothey tana woyko Aawa eronna gishosa. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Shin enti hessa hinte bolla oothiya wodey gakiya wode taani hintew odidaysa hinte akeekana mela taani hintew haysa odas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Sinthatada taani haysa hintew odonna gam7iday ta hintera de7iya gishosa. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Shin ha77i taani tana kiittidaysako bayis; hintefe oonika, ‘Awu bay?’ gidi tana oychey baawa. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Shin taani hessa odida gisho, hinte wozanan daro azzanoy de7ees. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Shin taani hintew tuma odayis; taani biiko hintew lo77o. Ayis giiko, taani boonna ixiko minthetheysi hinteko yeenna. Shin taani biiko iya hinteko yeddana. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Minthetheysi yidi, nagaraba, xillotethabaanne pirdaba ha alamiya asaa erisana. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Nagarabay, asay tana ammanonna gishosa. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Xillotethabay, taani Aawako biya gishonne hinte tana zaari be7onna gishosa. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Pirdabay, qassi alamiya haareysi pirdetida gishosa.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Taani hintew odiyabay darobay de7ees, shin ha77i hintew gelenna. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Tuma Ayyaanay yaa wode hintena tumatethaa ubbaako kaalethana. I si7idaba odeesipe attishin, baape aybibaaka odenna. Qassi sinthafe yaanaba hintew I odana. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />I taw de7eysafe ekidi hintew odiya gisho I tana bonchana. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Aawas de7iyaba ubbay tabaa; ‘Minthetheysi taw de7eysafe ekidi hintew odana’ taani giday hessasa.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hinte Azzanoy Ufaysan Laametana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Guutha wodepe guye tana be7eketa; qassi guutha wodepe guye hinte tana be7ana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Iya tamaaretape issoti issoti banta giddon, “Guutha wodepe guye hinte tana be7eketa; qassi guutha wodepe guye hinte tana be7ana; qassika taani Aawako bayis guussay woy guussee?” yaagidosona. <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />“Guutha wodepe guye geysi woy guussee? I ay odetiyako nuus eretenna” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Enti bana oychanaw koyeysa Yesuusi eridi, “Taani, ‘Guutha wodepe guye tana be7eketa; qassi guutha wodepe guye hinte tana be7ana’ gidaysas hinte issoy issuwa oycheetii? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Taani hintew tuma odayis; hinte yeekananne afuxana, shin ha alamey ufaytana. Ha77i hinte azzanana, shin hinte azzanoy ufaysan laametana. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Issi maccasiya na7a yelana haniya wode ba yelo wodey gakida gisho hirgawusu. Shin na7a yelidaape guye na7i ha alamiyan yeletida ufaysaa gisho ba un7aa dogawusu. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Hessadaka, hinteka hinte wozanan azzaneeta, shin taani hintena zaarada be7ana. Hinte wozanay daro ufaytana; he ufaysaa oonika hintefe ekenna.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“He gallas hinte tana aybibaaka woosseketa. Taani hintew tuma odayis; hinte ta sunthan woossiyaba ubbaa Aaway hintew immana. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Ha77i gakanaw ta sunthan aybibaaka woossibeketa. Hinte ufaysay polo gidana mela Xoossaa woossite; hinte ekana.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Taani ha77i gakanaw hintew leemison odas, hizape taani leemison odonna wodey yaana. Shin Aawaba taani hintew qoncen odana. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />He gallas hinte ta sunthan Aawa woossana; hinte gisho taani Aawa woossike. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Ayis giiko, Aaway ba huuphen hintena dosees. Hinte tana dosiya gishonne taani Aawa matape yidaysa ammanida gisho, I hintena dosees. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Taani Aawa matape ha alamiya yas; qassi alamiya aggada Aawako baana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Iya tamaareti zaaridi, “Heko, ha77i neeni qoncen odaasa; leemison aykoka odaka. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Neeni ubbaba ereysa nuuni ha77i eroos; qassi nena oonika oychana mela neeni koyaka. Hessi nuna neeni Xoossafe kiitetidaysa ammanthees” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yaatin, Yesuusi zaaridi entako, “Ha77i ammanetii? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Heko, hinte, hinte soo hinte soo laaletiya wodeynne ta xalaala yeggi aggidi baqatiya wodey yaana; ha77ika yikichis. Shin Aaway taara de7iya gisho taani ta xalaala gidike. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Hinte taara de7ishe saroy hintew daana mela taani hessa odas. Alamen de7ishe hinte waayetana. Shin minnite; taani alamiya xoonas” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesuusi hessa odidaape guye pude salo xeellidi, haysada yaagis: “Aawaw, saatey gakis; ne Na7ay nena bonchana mela neeni ne Na7aa boncha. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Neeni iyaw immida ubbaas I merinaa de7uwa immana mela asa ubbaa bolla iyaw maata immadasa. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Merinaa de7oy, nena, issi tuma Xoossaanne ne kiitida Yesuus Kiristoosa ero. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Neeni ta oothana mela immida oosuwa polada nena sa7an bonchas. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Ha77ika, Aawaw, alamey medhetanaape sinthe ne matan taw de7iya bonchuwan tana boncha.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Alamiya asaape neeni taw immidaysata nena erisas. Enti neyisata; neeni enta taw immadasa. Enti ne qaalaska kiitetidosona. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Neeni taw immida ubbabay neepe yidaysa enti ha77i eroosona. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Neeni taw immida qaala taani entaw immas; entika he qaala ekidosona. Taani ne matape yidaysi tuma gideysa eridi neeni tana kiittidaysaka ammanidosona.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Taani entaw woossayis. Enti neyisata gidiya gisho neeni taw immida asaas woossaysipe attishin, alamiyas woossike. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Taw de7iya ubbabay nebaa; new de7iya ubbayka tabaa. Taani enta baggara bonchetas. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Taani hizape guye alamiyan de7ike; enti alamen de7oosona. Taani ha77i neeko bayis. Geeshsha Aawaw, ha neeni taw immidaysati neeranne taara issino gididaysada enti issino gidana mela enta ne taw immida ne sunthan naaga. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Taani entara sa7an de7ashe, ne taw immida ne sunthaa wolqan enta naagas. Geeshsha Maxaafay gidaysi poletana mela dhayoy bessiya uraape attishin, entafe hari oonika dhaybeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Yoha 13:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />“Ha77i taani neeko bayis. Ta ufaysay enta wozanan polo gidana mela haysa taani alamen de7ashe odayis. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Taani entaw ne qaala immas. Taani alamiyape gidonaysada, entika alamiyape gidonna gisho, alamey enta ixis. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Neeni Xalahepe enta naagana melape attishin, alamepe kessana mela woossike. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Taani alamepe gidonaysada entika alamepe gidokona. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Neeni ne tumatethan enta nebaa ootha; ne qaalayka tuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Neeni tana alamiya kiitidaysada taanika enta alamiya kiittas. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Qassi enti tuma nebaa gidana mela enta gisho taani ta huuphiya new immayis.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Taani enta xalaalas gidonashin enti qaala odin, tana ammananaysataska woossayis. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Enti ubbay issino gidana mela taani woossayis. Aawaw, ne tanan de7eysada, qassi ta nenan de7eysada enti nunan daana mela woossayis. He wode neeni tana kiittidaysa alamey ammanana. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Neeninne taani issino gideysada, enti issino gidana mela, neeni tana bonchidaysada, taanika enta bonchas. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Taani entan, neeni tanan de7eysada enti polo issino gidana mela nena woossayis. Hessika, ne tana kiittidaysanne ne tana dosida dosuwan enta siiqidaysa alamey eran melasa.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Aawaw, neeni taw immidaysati taani de7iyasuwan taara daana mela koyayis. Alamey medhetanaape sinthe neeni tana dosida gisho, taw immida ta bonchuwa enti be7ana.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />“Geeshsha Aawaw, alamey nena erenna, shin taani erayis. Qassi neeni tana kiittidaysa haysati eroosona. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Neeni tana siiqida siiqoy entanan daana mela, qassi taani entanan gidana mela, taani ne sunthaa enta erisas; sinthaska erisana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Oyketis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Maato 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luqa 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesuusi woosa ongidaape guye, ba tamaaretara Qediroona zangaara pinnidi, he bessan de7iya atakiltiya giddo gelidosona. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yesuusi ubba wode ba tamaaretara yan shiiqiya gisho Yesuusa aathidi immida Yihudi he bessaa erees. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Hessa gisho, Yihudi paanose, xompe, tooranne gondalle oykida daro wotaadareta, kahine halaqatinne Farsaaweti kiitida Xoossa Keetha naagiya wotaadareta kaalethi ekidi, he bessaa bis.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesuusi bana gakana haniyaba ubbaa eridi, gaxa keyidi, “Oona koyeetii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Enti zaaridi, “Naazirete Yesuusa koyoos” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">I zaaridi, “Taani Yesuusa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesuusa aathidi immida Yihudi yan entara eqis. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />I, “Taani Yesuusa” gida wode enti guye shiiqidi, sa7an kundidosona. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesuusi qassika, “Oona koyeetii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Enti, “Naazirete Yesuusa koyoos” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />I zaaridi, “Taani Yesuusa gideysa hintew odas. Hiza, hinte tana koyaba gidiko haysata yeddite” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />I hessa giday, “Aawaw, neeni taw immidaysatape hari attoshin issuwaka dhaysabike” gidaysi poletana melasa.<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoon Phexroosas mashshay de7ees. I he mashsha shoddidi kahine halaqaa aylliyas ushacha haytha shocidi, qanxi yeggis. He aylliya sunthay Malkosa. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesuusi Phexroosako, “Ne mashsha shoohuwan zaara. Ta Aaway taw immida xuu7ape taani uyonnabaa new daanii?” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Maato 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luqa 22:42</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Haanna Sinthan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Maato 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mar 14:53-54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luqa 22:54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Roome wotaadaretinne enta halaqay Xoossa Keetha naagiya wotaadaretara issife Yesuusa oykidi qachidosona. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Koyro Yesuusa Haannako efidosona. Haanni he laythi kahine halaqa gidiya Qayyaafa bollo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Qayyaafi, “Asa ubbaa gisho, issi asi hayqiko lo77o” gidi kase Ayhudeta zoridaysa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49-50">Yoha 11:49-50</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexroosi Yesuusa Koyro Kaduwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Maato 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luqa 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoon Phexroosinne hara issi tamaarey Yesuusa kaallidi bidosona. Kahine halaqay he hara tamaariya loythi erees. Hessa gisho, I Yesuusara kahine halaqaa zabbaa gelis. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Shin Phexroosi karera dirsaa pengen eqis. Kahine halaqay eriya hara tamaarey kare keyidi, pengiya naagiya na7ees odidi, Phexroosa gaathi gelsis. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Pengiya naagiya na7iya Phexroosako, “Neeni, he addiya tamaaretape issuwa gidikii?” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Phexroosi zaaridi, “Akay, taani gidike” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Sa7ay meegiya gisho, aylletinne naageysati xiifa tama eethidi, kayoosona. Phexroosika entara eqidi tama kayees.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kahine Halaqay Yesuusa Oychis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Maato 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luqa 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Kahine halaqay Yesuusa, iya tamaaretabaanne iya timirtiyaba oychis. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani asa ubbaas qoncen odas. Taani Ayhude ubbay shiiqiya ayhude woosa keethaninne xoossa keethan ubba wode tamaarsas. Geeman aykoka odabike. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Yaatin, neeni tana ayis oychay? Ta odishin si7ida asaa oycha. He asay taani odidaysa eroosona” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yesuusi hessa gida wode, he bessan eqida wotaadaretape issoy Yesuusa baqidi, “Kahine halaqaas haysada zaaray?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani iitabaa odidaba gidiko haysan de7iya asa ubbaa sinthan oda. Shin taani tuma odidaba gidiko tana ayis baqay?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Hessa gisho, Haanni, Yesuusi qashetida mela kahine halaqaa Qayyaafako yeddis.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexroosi Yesuusa Nam7antho Kaddis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Maato 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luqa 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Phexroosi yan eqidi, tama kayishin, harati iyako, “Neeni ha addiya tamaaretape issuwa gidikii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Phexroosi zaaridi, “Akay, taani gidike” yaagidi kaddis.<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Kahine halaqaa aylletape issoy, Phexroosi haythaa qanxida addiya dabboy, Phexroosako, “Taani nena iyara atakiltiya giddon be7abikina?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Phexroosi qassika kaddis; ellesidi kuttoy waassi aggis.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Philaxoosa Sinthan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Maato 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luqa 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Wonta guura, enti Yesuusa Qayyaafa soope deriya haareysa ooso keethi eki efidosona. Ayhudeti Paasika Ba7aale kathaa maanaw bantana tunisonna mela deriya haareysa ooso keethaa gelibookona. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Hessa gisho, Philaxoosi entako kare keyidi, “Ha addiya ayis mootetii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Enti, “I iita oothonnaba gidiyako nuuni iya neeko ehoko” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Philaxoosi zaaridi, “Hinte iya eki efidi, hinte higgey geysada iya bolla pirdite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Ayhudeti, “Oonaka wodhiya maati nuus baawa” yaagidosona; <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Hessi haniday Yesuusi ay mela hayqo hayqaneko erisanaw odidaysi poletanaasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Yoha 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Philaxoosi ba ooso keetha zaari gelidi, Yesuusa xeegidi, “Neeni Ayhude kawo?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesuusi Philaxoosa, “Ha oysha neeni neepe oychaye woyko hara asi new tabaa odidee?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Philaxoosi zaaridi, “Ta Ayhude asee? Ne asaynne kahine halaqati nena taw aathidi immidosona. Ne ay oothadii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesuusi, “Ta kawotethay ha alamiyana gidenna. I haysan gidiyako ta Ayhudeta halaqatas aadhada imetonna mela ta aylleti taw oletana. Shin ta kawotethay ha alamiyana gidenna” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Hessa gisho, Philaxoosi Yesuusako, “Yaatin, neeni kawoyee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Tuma ta kawo gideysa ne gadasa. Taani yeletidaynne ha alamiya yiday tumatethaas markatanaasa. Tumaa bagga gidida oonika taani geysa si7ees” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Philaxoosi, “Tumi aybee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Philaxoosi hessa gidaape guye Ayhudetako kare keyidi, “Taani iyape ay iitaka demmabike. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Shin Paasika Ba7aale gallas, issi ase hintew qashope billiya meezey de7ees. Taani hintew Ayhudeta kawa billana mela koyeetii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Enti zaaridi, banta qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Barbaana billafe attishin, iya gidenna” yaagidosona. Shin Barbaani panga.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Tooshetis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-32">Maato 27:27-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:15-21">Mar 15:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Hessafe guye, Philaxoosi Yesuusa garaafisis. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Wotaaddareti aguntha kallacha medhidi iya huuphen wothidosona. Qassi zo7o ma7o iya mayzidosona. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Iyako shiiqidi, “Ayhude kawaw, merinaw kawota” yaagidi iya baqidosona.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Philaxoosi qassika kare keyidi, Ayhudetako, “Heko, taani iyape ay iitaka demmaboonnaysa hinte erana mela iya hinteko kare kessana” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Hessafe guye, Yesuusi aguntha kallacha ba huuphen wothidi, zo7o ma7o ma7idi, kare keyis. Philaxoosi Ayhudetako, “Uraa haysa be7ite” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Kahine halaqatinne Xoossa Keetha naageysati iya be7ida wode, banta qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Masqaliya bolla kaqa! Kaqa!” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Philaxoosi entako, “Hinte iya efidi, masqaliya bolla kaqite. Taani iyape ay iitaka demmabike” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Ayhudeti zaaridi, “Nuus higgey de7ees. I bana Xoossaa na7a oothida gisho nu higgiyatho I hayqanaw bessees” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Philaxoosi hessa si7ida wode kaseysafe daro yayyis. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Qassika Philaxoosi ba ooso keethi simmi gelidi Yesuusako, “Neeni awupe yadii?” yaagidi oychis. Shin Yesuusi iyaw aykoka zaaribeenna. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Hessa gisho, Philaxoosi, “Taw odikii? Nena billanaw woyko masqaliya bolla kaqanaw taw maati de7eysa erikii?” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesuusi, “Xoossay new maata immiboonnaba gidiyako ta bolla maati new deennashin. Hessa gisho, tana new aathidi immidaysi aadhiya nagara oothis” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Hayqo Pirdetis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Maato 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mar 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luqa 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Philaxoosi hessa si7ida wode Yesuusa billanaw oge koyis. Shin Ayhudeti banta qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Neeni iya billiyabaa gidiko Kawa Qeesare bagga gidaka. Bana kawo giya oonika Qeesare morke” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Philaxoosi hessa si7idi Yesuusa kare kessis. Yaatidi, “Loche Shuchi” geetetiya bessan pirda oydiyan uttis. Ibraawetho doonan he bessay “Gabate” guussu. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />He gallasay Paasika Ba7aale bonchanaw giigetetha gallas. Sa7ay usupun saate heera. Philaxoosi Ayhudetako, “Hinte kawa haysa be7ite” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Ayhudeti banta qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Digga! Digga! Masqaliya bolla kaqa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Philaxoosi zaaridi, “Hinte kawa taani masqaliya bolla kaqanaysa koyeetii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Kahine halaqati, “Qeesarepe hara kawoy nuus baawa” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Hessafe guye, enti Yesuusa masqaliya bolla kaqana mela Philaxoosi entaw aathidi immis.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesuusi Kaqetis</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Maato 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luqa 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Enti Yesuusa oykidi efidosona. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesuusi ba masqaliya tookidi, “Huuphe guugge” geetetiya bessaa bis. “Huuphe guugge” guussay Ibraawetho doonan “Golgota” guussu. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Enti he bessan masqaliya bolla Yesuusa kaqidosona. Qassi iyara hara nam7u asata, issuwa ya baggara hankuwa ha baggara masqaliya bolla kaqidosona. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Philaxoosi, “Ayhudeta Kawa, Naazirete Yesuusa” giya xuufe xaafidi masqaliya bolla wothis. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Yesuusi masqaliya bolla kaqetida bessay katamas matan de7iya gisho, daro Ayhudeti he xuufiya nabbabidosona. Xuufey xaafetiday Ibraawetho doonan, Laatine doonaninne Girike doonana. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Hessa gisho, kahine halaqati Philaxoosako, “ ‘Ha addey bana Ayhude kawo yaagis’ gada xaafape attishin, ‘Ayhude kawo’ gada xaafopa” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Yaatin, Philaxoosi, “Ta xaafidaysa xaafas” yaagidi zaaris.<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Wotaaddareti masqaliya bolla iya kaqidaape guye, iya ma7uwa ekidi, oyddu bessan shaakidi, isso isso ekidosona. Yeda ma7etiya iya adussa ma7uwa ekidosona. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Wotaaddareti, “Oona gakaneeko, saama yegganaape attishin, ma7uwa peedhoko” yaagidosona. Hessi haniday Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Ta ma7uwa shaaki ekidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">ta adussa ma7uwa bollaka saama yeggidosona”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">geetetidaysi poletana melasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz 22:18</ref>.</char></note> Hessa gisho, wotaadareti hessa oothidosona.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Shin Yesuusa masqaliya matan iya aayiya, iya aaye michiya, Qeliyoophe machiya Mayraamanne Magdela Mayraama eqidosona. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesuusi ba aayiwunne I dosiya tamaarey yan eqidaysata be7idi, ba aayeko, “Ta aaye, ne na7aa haysa be7a” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Hessafe guye, he tamaariyako, “Ne aayiw hanno be7a” yaagis. He tamaarey iyo he wodepe doomidi baara daana mela soo efis.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Maato 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luqa 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Hessafe guye, Yesuusi ubbay ha77i poletidaysa eridi, Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafetidaysi poletana mela “Tana saamees” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />He bessan issi xugga kumetha caala woyney de7ees. Enti isponje he woyniyan yeggidi, hisoophe mitha xeeran wothidi, Yesuusa doonako shiishidosona. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesuusi woyniya ganxi be7idi, “Poletis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Hessafe guye, ba huuphiya ziqi oothidi ba shempuwa immis.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />He gallasay giigetetha gallas gidiya gishonne wontetha gallasay boncho Sambaata gidiya gisho, asata ahay masqaliya bolla Sambaata gallas pee7onna mela enta tohuwa menthidi, masqaliyape wodhisana mela Ayhudeti Philaxoosa woossidosona. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Hessa gisho, wotaadareti bidi, Yesuusara kaqetida nam7u asata tohuwa menthidosona. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Shin Yesuusako yida wode I hayqidaysa be7idi, iya tohuwa menthibookona. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Shin wotaadaretape issoy iya miya tooran caddin iiraka suuthinne haathi goggis. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Hinte ammanana mela hessa be7idaysi markatis. Iya markatethayka tuma. Qassi I odeysi tuma gideysa erees. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Hessi haniday Geeshsha Maxaafay, “Iya meqethatape issoyka meqenna” gidaysi poletana melasa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Kessa 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Taybo 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Maz 34:20</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Qassika Geeshsha Maxaafay hara bessan, “Enti banta caddidaysa be7ana” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zaka 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Qon 1:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Moogetis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Maato 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luqa 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Hessafe guye, Armaate katamape yida Yoosefi Yesuusa aha ekanaw Philaxoosa woossis. Yoosefi Ayhudetas yayyida gisho qosan Yesuusa kaalleysa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:38">Philaxoosi, “Eka” yaagis. Hessa gisho, Yoosefi bidi Yesuusa aha ekis. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Qassi Niqodimoosi hessafe kase Yesuusako qamma yidaysi, karbenne godare uuthara walaketida hastamanne issi kilo giraame gidiya shitto ekidi Yoosefara yis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Yoha 3:1-2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />He nam7u asati Yesuusa aha ekidi, Ayhudeti aha xaaxiya maaran, shittora, moogo afilan xaaxidosona. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Yesuusi masqaliya bolla kaqetida bessan daro atakiltey de7ees. He atakiltiya giddon shuchafe woocetidi oosetida buroo oonika moogetiboonna ooratha duufoy de7ees. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />He gongoloy matan de7iya gishonne Ayhudeti Sambaatas giigetiya gallas gidiya gisho, Yesuusa aha yan moogidosona.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa Hayqope Denduwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Maato 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luqa 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Wogga wode wonta buroo geeyonna de7ishin, Magdela Mayraama, Yesuusi moogetida duufuwa bada shuchay he duufuwa doonape dendidaysa be7asu. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Simoon Phexroosakonne Yesuusi dosiya hanko tamaariyako woxa bada, “Duufuwape Godaa efidosona; iya awun wothidaako nu eroko” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Hessa gisho, Phexroosinne hanko tamaarey keyidi duufuwa bidosona. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Nam7ayka issife woxidosona, shin hanko tamaarey Phexroosape aadhidi sinthatidi duufuwa gakis. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />He tamaarey hokidi, moogo afilaa be7is, shin duufuwan wodhibeenna. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoon Phexroosi iya kaalli yidi, duufuwan wodhidi moogo afilay yan de7eysa be7is. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Qassi Yesuusa huuphen xaaxetida afilay xaaxetida mela dumma issi bessan de7eysa be7is. He afilay dumma de7eesipe attishin, moogo afilara issife deenna. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />He wode, sinthatidi duufuwa gakida hanko tamaarey geli be7idi ammanis. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Yesuusi hayqope dendanaw besseysa odiya Geeshsha maxaafaa qaala enti buroo akeekibokona. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Hessafe guye, iya tamaareti banta soo simmi bidosona.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Magdela Mayraamis Qoncis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Maato 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Shin Mayraama he duufuwa doonan eqada yeekashe hokada duufuwa giddo xeellasu. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Bootha ma7o ma7ida nam7u kiitanchoti Yesuusa ahay zin7ida bessan issoy huuphesoora hankoy tohosoora uttidashin be7asu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Enti iiko, “Maccasete, ayis yeekay?” yaagidi oychidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Iya, “Enti ta Godaa efidosona; enti awun wothidaako taani erike” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Hessa gidaape guye, iya guye simma xeelliya wode, Yesuusi yan eqidaysa be7asu. Shin I Yesuusa gididaysa erabuku. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesuusi iiko, “Maccasete, ayis yeekay? Oona koyay?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Mayraama atakilte oosanchuwa daanin, “Godaw, ne ekidaba gidiko, iya awun wothidaako taw odarkii. Taani iya ekana” yaagasu.<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesuusi iiko, “Mayraame” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Iya iyako simmada, Ibraawetho doonan “Rebuuni” yaagasu. Hessas birshethay “Astamaariyaw” guussu.<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesuusi iiko, “Taani buroo ta Aawako boonna gisho, tana oykofa. Shin ta ishatako bada, ‘Taani ta Aawakonne hinte Aawako, ta Xoossaakonne hinte Xoossaako, simmana gis’ gada entaw oda” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Magdela Mayraama Godaa be7idaysanne iw hessa I odidaysa bada iya tamaaretas odasu.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Ba Tamaaretas Qoncis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Maato 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luqa 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Wogga wode omarsi, iya tamaareti Ayhudetas yayyidi kariya gordidi shiiqi uttidashin, Yesuusi yidi, enta giddon eqidi, “Saroy hintew gido” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Hessa gidi simmidi ba kushiyanne ba miya enta bessis. Iya tamaareti Godaa be7ida wode daro ufaytidosona. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesuusi zaaridi entako, “Saroy hintew gido; ta Aaway tana kiitidaysada taanika hintena kiittayis” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Hessa gidaape guye, enta bolla ufu gidi punnis. Qassi, “Geeshsha Ayyaana ekite. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Hinte atto gida asaa nagaray atto geetetana. Hinte atto goonnayisata nagaray atto geetetenna” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Maato 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusanne Toomasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Shin tammanne nam7u tamaaretape issoy, Didimoosa geetetiya Toomasi, Yesuusi yida wode entara deenna. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Hessa gisho, hanko iya tamaareti Toomasako, “Nuuni Godaa be7ida” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Shin Toomasi entako, “Misimaaren I cadetida iya kushiyan de7iya beeta be7onnanne he beeta ta biradhen bochonna, qassi ta kushiya iya miyen yedda be7onna ammanike” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Saamintafe guye, Yesuusa tamaareti qassika son shiiqidi uttidosona; Toomasika entara de7ees. Karey gordetidi de7ishin Yesuusi yidi, enta giddon eqidi, “Saroy hintew gido” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Toomasako, “Ta kushiya ne biradhen bochada be7a. Qassi ne kushiya ta miyiyan yedda be7a. Neeni sidhopa, ammana” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toomasi zaaridi, “Ta Godaw, ta Xoossaw” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yaatin Yesuusi, “Neeni tana be7ida gisho ammanadasa, shin tana be7onna ammanidaysati anjetidaysata” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesuusi ha maxaafan xaafetiboonna hara daro malaatata ba tamaareta sinthan oothis. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Shin Yesuusi I Kiristoosa, Xoossaa Na7aa gideysa hinte ammanana melanne ammanidi iya sunthan de7o demmana mela haysi xaafetis.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesuusi Laapun Tamaaretas Qoncis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Xibradoosa Abba matan ba tamaaretas zaari qoncis. I entaw haysafe kaallidi de7iya hanotan qoncis. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoon Phexroosi, Mente geetetiya Toomasi, Qaana Galilape yida Natina7eeli, Zabdiyoosa naytinne Yesuusa tamaaretape hara nam7ati issife de7oosona.<verse eid="JHN 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoon Phexroosi entako, “Taani molo oykanaw bayis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luqa 5:5</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Enti, “Nuka neera baana” yaagidi, wogoluwa giddo gelidosona. Shin enti he qamman aybi moloka oykibookona.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Wonta guura xalqey dolanaape sinthe, Yesuusi abba gaxan eqis, shin iya tamaareti Yesuusa gididaysa eribookona. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yesuusi entako, “Ta laggeto, molo oykibeeketii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Enti zaaridi, “Aykoka oykibooko” yaagidosona.<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />I zaaridi, “Hinte gitiya wogoluwape ushacha baggara yeggite; guutha molo hinte oykana” yaagis. Hessa gisho, gitiya ushacha baggara yeggidosona. Moloy darida gisho goochi kessanaw xoonetidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:6">Luqa 5:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Yesuusi dosiya tamaarey Phexroosako, “Haysi Godaa!” yaagis. Simoon Phexroosi I Godaa gidaysa si7ida wode, kallo de7iya gisho, ba ma7uwa ma7idi abba giddo gupi gelis. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Shin wogoluwan attida hanko tamaareti moloy kumida gitiya goochidi, abbaafe gaxa keyidosona. Enti abbaafe nam7u xeetu wadha mela haakoosona. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Enti abbaafe gaxa keyida wode, xiifa bonqon moloy de7eysanne uythi be7idosona.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesuusi entako, “Ha77i hinte oykida moluwape guuthara hammite” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoon Phexroosi wogoluwan gelidi, xeetanne ishatammanne heedzu wogga moloti kumida gitiya goochidi abbaafe gaxa kessis. Moloy hessa mela daro gidin gitey daaketibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesuusi entako, “Haa yidi miite” yaagis. I Godaa gideysa enti erida gisho, iya tamaaretape issoyka, “Neeni oonee?” gidi iya oychanaw minniday baawa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesuusi yidi, uythaa ekidi entaw immis; moluwaka hessada immis.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Yesuusi hayqope dendidi ba tamaaretas qoncishin haysi heedzantho.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusanne Phexroosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Enti midaape guye, Yesuusi Simoon Phexroosako, “Yoona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yoona: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girike doonan Yoona geetetiya sunthay Yohaanisa geetetiya sunthaas saphotho sunthu.</char></note> na7aw Simoona, tana haysatape aathada dosay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Simoon Phexroosi, “Ee Godaw, taani nena doseysa ne eraasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesuusi iyako, “Ta dorsa marata heemma” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesuusi qassika, “Yoona na7aw Simoona, tana dosay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Simoon Phexroosi, “Ee Godaw, taani nena doseysa ne eraasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesuusi, “Ta dorsata heemma” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yesuusi heedzantho, “Yoona na7aw Simoona, tana dosay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesuusi heedzantho Simoon Phexroosako, “Tana dosay?” yaagidi oychida gisho, Phexroosi azzanidi, “Godaw, neeni ubbaba eraasa; taani nena doseysa ne eraasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesuusi, “Ta dorsata heemma. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Taani new tuma odayis; neeni na7atethan de7iya wode, nerka dancetada, ne koyida soo baasa. Shin ne cimida wode ne kushiya micca bessaana. Hari dancisana; ne dosonna soo efana” yaagis. <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesuusi hessa Phexroosi ay mela hayqo hayqidi, Xoossaa bonchisaneeko erisanaw gis. Hessa gidaape guye, Yesuusi Phexroosako, “Tana kaalla” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusanne Dosetida Tamaariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Phexroosi guye simmidi, Yesuusi dosiya tamaarey baape guyera yeysa be7is. He tamaarey, kaho miya bessan Yesuusako shiiqidi, “Godaw, nena aathidi immanay oonee?” gidaysa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:25">Yoha 13:25</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Phexroosi he tamaariya be7idi, “Godaw, ha addey qassi waananee?” yaagidi Yesuusa oychis.<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesuusi iyako, “Taani yaana gakanaw I daana mela taani koyko, hessi nena ay metidee? Neeni tana kaalla” yaagis.<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Hessa gisho, he tamaarey hayqenna giya oday ishata ubbaa gakis. Shin Yesuusi, “Taani yaana gakanaw, I daana mela taani koyko nena ay metidee?” yaagisipe attishin, “Hayqenna” gibeenna.<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ha odabaa markatidaynne haysa xaafiday he tamaariya. Iya markatethay tuma gideysa nuuni eroos.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yesuusi oothida hara darobay de7ees. Ta qopin, ubbabay huuphen huuphen xaafetidaako, xaafetiya maxaafatas kumetha alamey wothanaw gidanaba daanenna.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>